#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:6
msgid "Coroutines and tasks"
msgstr "協程與任務"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:8
msgid ""
"This section outlines high-level asyncio APIs to work with coroutines and "
"Tasks."
msgstr "本節概述用於處理協程與任務的高階 asyncio API。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:19 ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:148
msgid "Coroutines"
msgstr "協程"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:21
msgid "**Source code:** :source:`Lib/asyncio/coroutines.py`"
msgstr "**原始碼：**\\ :source:`Lib/asyncio/coroutines.py`"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:25
msgid ""
":term:`Coroutines <coroutine>` declared with the async/await syntax is the "
"preferred way of writing asyncio applications.  For example, the following "
"snippet of code prints \"hello\", waits 1 second, and then prints \"world\"::"
msgstr ""
"以 async/await 語法宣告的\\ :term:`協程 (coroutine) <coroutine>`\\ 是撰寫 "
"asyncio 應用程式的推薦方式。例如，以下程式碼片段會印出 \"hello\"、等待 1 秒，"
"然後印出 \"world\"： ::"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:30
msgid ""
">>> import asyncio\n"
"\n"
">>> async def main():\n"
"...     print('hello')\n"
"...     await asyncio.sleep(1)\n"
"...     print('world')\n"
"\n"
">>> asyncio.run(main())\n"
"hello\n"
"world"
msgstr ""
">>> import asyncio\n"
"\n"
">>> async def main():\n"
"...     print('hello')\n"
"...     await asyncio.sleep(1)\n"
"...     print('world')\n"
"\n"
">>> asyncio.run(main())\n"
"hello\n"
"world"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:41
msgid ""
"Note that simply calling a coroutine will not schedule it to be executed::"
msgstr "請注意，單純呼叫一個協程並不會將其排程執行： ::"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:44
msgid ""
">>> main()\n"
"<coroutine object main at 0x1053bb7c8>"
msgstr ""
">>> main()\n"
"<coroutine object main at 0x1053bb7c8>"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:47
msgid "To actually run a coroutine, asyncio provides the following mechanisms:"
msgstr "為了實際執行協程，asyncio 提供了以下機制："

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:49
msgid ""
"The :func:`asyncio.run` function to run the top-level entry point \"main()\" "
"function (see the above example.)"
msgstr ""
"使用 :func:`asyncio.run` 函式來執行最上層的進入點函式 \"main()\"（請參閱上面"
"的範例）。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:52
msgid ""
"Awaiting on a coroutine.  The following snippet of code will print \"hello\" "
"after waiting for 1 second, and then print \"world\" after waiting for "
"*another* 2 seconds::"
msgstr ""
"等待 (await) 一個協程。以下程式碼片段會在等待 1 秒後印出 \"hello\"，然後\\ *"
"再*\\ 等待 2 秒後印出 \"world\"： ::"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:56
msgid ""
"import asyncio\n"
"import time\n"
"\n"
"async def say_after(delay, what):\n"
"    await asyncio.sleep(delay)\n"
"    print(what)\n"
"\n"
"async def main():\n"
"    print(f\"started at {time.strftime('%X')}\")\n"
"\n"
"    await say_after(1, 'hello')\n"
"    await say_after(2, 'world')\n"
"\n"
"    print(f\"finished at {time.strftime('%X')}\")\n"
"\n"
"asyncio.run(main())"
msgstr ""
"import asyncio\n"
"import time\n"
"\n"
"async def say_after(delay, what):\n"
"    await asyncio.sleep(delay)\n"
"    print(what)\n"
"\n"
"async def main():\n"
"    print(f\"started at {time.strftime('%X')}\")\n"
"\n"
"    await say_after(1, 'hello')\n"
"    await say_after(2, 'world')\n"
"\n"
"    print(f\"finished at {time.strftime('%X')}\")\n"
"\n"
"asyncio.run(main())"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:73
msgid "Expected output::"
msgstr "預期的輸出： ::"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:75
msgid ""
"started at 17:13:52\n"
"hello\n"
"world\n"
"finished at 17:13:55"
msgstr ""
"started at 17:13:52\n"
"hello\n"
"world\n"
"finished at 17:13:55"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:80
msgid ""
"The :func:`asyncio.create_task` function to run coroutines concurrently as "
"asyncio :class:`Tasks <Task>`."
msgstr ""
"使用 :func:`asyncio.create_task` 函式，將協程作為 asyncio :class:`Task` 並行"
"地執行。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:83
msgid ""
"Let's modify the above example and run two ``say_after`` coroutines "
"*concurrently*::"
msgstr "修改上面的範例，*並行地*\\ 執行兩個 ``say_after`` 協程： ::"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:86
msgid ""
"async def main():\n"
"    task1 = asyncio.create_task(\n"
"        say_after(1, 'hello'))\n"
"\n"
"    task2 = asyncio.create_task(\n"
"        say_after(2, 'world'))\n"
"\n"
"    print(f\"started at {time.strftime('%X')}\")\n"
"\n"
"    # Wait until both tasks are completed (should take\n"
"    # around 2 seconds.)\n"
"    await task1\n"
"    await task2\n"
"\n"
"    print(f\"finished at {time.strftime('%X')}\")"
msgstr ""
"async def main():\n"
"    task1 = asyncio.create_task(\n"
"        say_after(1, 'hello'))\n"
"\n"
"    task2 = asyncio.create_task(\n"
"        say_after(2, 'world'))\n"
"\n"
"    print(f\"started at {time.strftime('%X')}\")\n"
"\n"
"    # 等待直到兩個任務都完成（應該需要\n"
"    # 大約 2 秒。）\n"
"    await task1\n"
"    await task2\n"
"\n"
"    print(f\"finished at {time.strftime('%X')}\")"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:102
msgid ""
"Note that expected output now shows that the snippet runs 1 second faster "
"than before::"
msgstr "請注意，預期的輸出現在顯示這段程式碼的執行時間比之前快了 1 秒： ::"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:105
msgid ""
"started at 17:14:32\n"
"hello\n"
"world\n"
"finished at 17:14:34"
msgstr ""
"started at 17:14:32\n"
"hello\n"
"world\n"
"finished at 17:14:34"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:110
msgid ""
"The :class:`asyncio.TaskGroup` class provides a more modern alternative to :"
"func:`create_task`. Using this API, the last example becomes::"
msgstr ""
":class:`asyncio.TaskGroup` 類別提供了比 :func:`create_task` 更現代的替代方"
"案。使用這個 API，上一個範例會變成： ::"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:114
msgid ""
"async def main():\n"
"    async with asyncio.TaskGroup() as tg:\n"
"        task1 = tg.create_task(\n"
"            say_after(1, 'hello'))\n"
"\n"
"        task2 = tg.create_task(\n"
"            say_after(2, 'world'))\n"
"\n"
"        print(f\"started at {time.strftime('%X')}\")\n"
"\n"
"    # The await is implicit when the context manager exits.\n"
"\n"
"    print(f\"finished at {time.strftime('%X')}\")"
msgstr ""
"async def main():\n"
"    async with asyncio.TaskGroup() as tg:\n"
"        task1 = tg.create_task(\n"
"            say_after(1, 'hello'))\n"
"\n"
"        task2 = tg.create_task(\n"
"            say_after(2, 'world'))\n"
"\n"
"        print(f\"started at {time.strftime('%X')}\")\n"
"\n"
"    # 當情境管理器結束時會隱式地進行 await。\n"
"\n"
"    print(f\"finished at {time.strftime('%X')}\")"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:128
msgid "The timing and output should be the same as for the previous version."
msgstr "執行時間與輸出應該與前一個版本相同。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:130
msgid ":class:`asyncio.TaskGroup`."
msgstr ":class:`asyncio.TaskGroup`。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:137
msgid "Awaitables"
msgstr "可等待物件"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:139
msgid ""
"We say that an object is an **awaitable** object if it can be used in an :"
"keyword:`await` expression.  Many asyncio APIs are designed to accept "
"awaitables."
msgstr ""
"如果一個物件可以用在 :keyword:`await` 運算式中，就稱它為\\ **可等待** "
"(awaitable) 物件。許多 asyncio API 都被設計為接受可等待物件。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:143
msgid ""
"There are three main types of *awaitable* objects: **coroutines**, "
"**Tasks**, and **Futures**."
msgstr "*可等待*\\ 物件主要有三種：**協程**、**任務**\\ 和 **Future**。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:149
msgid ""
"Python coroutines are *awaitables* and therefore can be awaited from other "
"coroutines::"
msgstr "Python 協程是\\ *可等待物件*，因此可以在其他協程中被等待： ::"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:152
msgid ""
"import asyncio\n"
"\n"
"async def nested():\n"
"    return 42\n"
"\n"
"async def main():\n"
"    # Nothing happens if we just call \"nested()\".\n"
"    # A coroutine object is created but not awaited,\n"
"    # so it *won't run at all*.\n"
"    nested()  # will raise a \"RuntimeWarning\".\n"
"\n"
"    # Let's do it differently now and await it:\n"
"    print(await nested())  # will print \"42\".\n"
"\n"
"asyncio.run(main())"
msgstr ""
"import asyncio\n"
"\n"
"async def nested():\n"
"    return 42\n"
"\n"
"async def main():\n"
"    # 如果只是呼叫 \"nested()\"，什麼事都不會發生。\n"
"    # 這會建立一個協程物件，但它沒有被等待，\n"
"    # 所以它*完全不會執行*。\n"
"    nested()  # 會引發 \"RuntimeWarning\"。\n"
"\n"
"    # 現在換個方式，改為等待它：\n"
"    print(await nested())  # 會印出 \"42\"。\n"
"\n"
"asyncio.run(main())"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:170
msgid ""
"In this documentation the term \"coroutine\" can be used for two closely "
"related concepts:"
msgstr "在此文件中，「協程」一詞可用來指稱兩個密切相關的概念："

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:173
msgid "a *coroutine function*: an :keyword:`async def` function;"
msgstr "*協程函式*：一個 :keyword:`async def` 函式；"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:175
msgid ""
"a *coroutine object*: an object returned by calling a *coroutine function*."
msgstr "*協程物件*：呼叫\\ *協程函式*\\ 所回傳的物件。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:180
msgid "Tasks"
msgstr "任務"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:181
msgid "*Tasks* are used to schedule coroutines *concurrently*."
msgstr "*Task*\\ 被用來\\ *並行地*\\ 排程協程。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:183
msgid ""
"When a coroutine is wrapped into a *Task* with functions like :func:`asyncio."
"create_task` the coroutine is automatically scheduled to run soon::"
msgstr ""
"當協程透過 :func:`asyncio.create_task` 等函式被包裝成一個 *Task* 時，該協程會"
"自動被排程為即將執行： ::"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:187
msgid ""
"import asyncio\n"
"\n"
"async def nested():\n"
"    return 42\n"
"\n"
"async def main():\n"
"    # Schedule nested() to run soon concurrently\n"
"    # with \"main()\".\n"
"    task = asyncio.create_task(nested())\n"
"\n"
"    # \"task\" can now be used to cancel \"nested()\", or\n"
"    # can simply be awaited to wait until it is complete:\n"
"    await task\n"
"\n"
"asyncio.run(main())"
msgstr ""
"import asyncio\n"
"\n"
"async def nested():\n"
"    return 42\n"
"\n"
"async def main():\n"
"    # 將 nested() 排程為即將與 \"main()\"\n"
"    # 並行執行。\n"
"    task = asyncio.create_task(nested())\n"
"\n"
"    # 現在 \"task\" 可以用來取消 \"nested()\"，\n"
"    # 或者直接等待它，直到它完成：\n"
"    await task\n"
"\n"
"asyncio.run(main())"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:205
msgid "Futures"
msgstr "Futures"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:206
msgid ""
"A :class:`Future` is a special **low-level** awaitable object that "
"represents an **eventual result** of an asynchronous operation."
msgstr ""
":class:`Future` 是一種特殊的\\ **低階**\\ 可等待物件，代表非同步操作的\\ **最"
"終結果**。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:209
msgid ""
"When a Future object is *awaited* it means that the coroutine will wait "
"until the Future is resolved in some other place."
msgstr ""
"當一個 Future 物件被\\ *等待*\\ 時，代表協程會等待，直到該 Future 在其他地方"
"被完成 (resolved)。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:212
msgid ""
"Future objects in asyncio are needed to allow callback-based code to be used "
"with async/await."
msgstr ""
"asyncio 中需要 Future 物件，才能讓基於回呼的程式碼與 async/await 搭配使用。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:215
msgid ""
"Normally **there is no need** to create Future objects at the application "
"level code."
msgstr "通常在應用程式層級的程式碼中\\ **不需要**\\ 建立 Future 物件。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:218
msgid ""
"Future objects, sometimes exposed by libraries and some asyncio APIs, can be "
"awaited::"
msgstr ""
"Future 物件有時會由函式庫和某些 asyncio API 公開出來，它們可以被等待： ::"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:221
msgid ""
"async def main():\n"
"    await function_that_returns_a_future_object()\n"
"\n"
"    # this is also valid:\n"
"    await asyncio.gather(\n"
"        function_that_returns_a_future_object(),\n"
"        some_python_coroutine()\n"
"    )"
msgstr ""
"async def main():\n"
"    await function_that_returns_a_future_object()\n"
"\n"
"    # 這樣也是有效的：\n"
"    await asyncio.gather(\n"
"        function_that_returns_a_future_object(),\n"
"        some_python_coroutine()\n"
"    )"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:230
msgid ""
"A good example of a low-level function that returns a Future object is :meth:"
"`loop.run_in_executor`."
msgstr ""
":meth:`loop.run_in_executor` 就是會回傳 Future 物件之低階函式的好例子。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:235
msgid "Creating tasks"
msgstr "建立任務"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:237
msgid "**Source code:** :source:`Lib/asyncio/tasks.py`"
msgstr "**原始碼：**\\ :source:`Lib/asyncio/tasks.py`"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:243
msgid ""
"Wrap the *coro* :ref:`coroutine <coroutine>` into a :class:`Task` and "
"schedule its execution.  Return the Task object."
msgstr ""
"將 *coro* :ref:`協程 <coroutine>`\\ 包裝成 :class:`Task` 並為其排程執行。回傳"
"該 Task 物件。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:246
msgid ""
"The full function signature is largely the same as that of the :class:`Task` "
"constructor (or factory) - all of the keyword arguments to this function are "
"passed through to that interface."
msgstr ""
"完整的函式簽名與 :class:`Task` 建構函式（或工廠）的簽名大致相同：此函式的所有"
"關鍵字引數都會被傳遞給該介面。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:250
msgid ""
"An optional keyword-only *context* argument allows specifying a custom :"
"class:`contextvars.Context` for the *coro* to run in. The current context "
"copy is created when no *context* is provided."
msgstr ""
"可選的僅限關鍵字引數 *context* 允許指定一個自訂的 :class:`contextvars."
"Context` 讓 *coro* 在其中執行。如果沒有提供 *context*，則會建立目前情境的副"
"本。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:254
msgid ""
"An optional keyword-only *eager_start* argument allows specifying if the "
"task should execute eagerly during the call to create_task, or be scheduled "
"later. If *eager_start* is not passed the mode set by :meth:`loop."
"set_task_factory` will be used."
msgstr ""
"可選的僅限關鍵字引數 *eager_start* 允許指定任務應在呼叫 create_task 期間急切"
"地 (eagerly) 執行，還是稍後再被排程。如果沒有傳入 *eager_start*，則會使用由 :"
"meth:`loop.set_task_factory` 所設定的模式。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:259
msgid ""
"The task is executed in the loop returned by :func:`get_running_loop`, :exc:"
"`RuntimeError` is raised if there is no running loop in current thread."
msgstr ""
"該任務會在 :func:`get_running_loop` 回傳的迴圈中執行；如果目前執行緒中沒有正"
"在執行的迴圈，則會引發 :exc:`RuntimeError`。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:265
msgid ""
":meth:`asyncio.TaskGroup.create_task` is a new alternative leveraging "
"structural concurrency; it allows for waiting for a group of related tasks "
"with strong safety guarantees."
msgstr ""
":meth:`asyncio.TaskGroup.create_task` 是利用結構化並行 (structured "
"concurrency) 的新替代方案；它能在強力的安全保證下等待一組相關的任務。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:271
msgid ""
"Save a reference to the result of this function, to avoid a task "
"disappearing mid-execution. The event loop only keeps weak references to "
"tasks. A task that isn't referenced elsewhere may get garbage collected at "
"any time, even before it's done. For reliable \"fire-and-forget\" background "
"tasks, gather them in a collection::"
msgstr ""
"請保存此函式結果的參照，以避免任務在執行途中消失。事件迴圈只會保留對任務的弱"
"參照。沒有在其他地方被參照的任務可能隨時被垃圾回收，甚至在它完成之前。若需要"
"可靠的「射後不理 (fire-and-forget)」背景任務，請將它們收集在一個容器中： ::"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:278
msgid ""
"background_tasks = set()\n"
"\n"
"for i in range(10):\n"
"    task = asyncio.create_task(some_coro(param=i))\n"
"\n"
"    # Add task to the set. This creates a strong reference.\n"
"    background_tasks.add(task)\n"
"\n"
"    # To prevent keeping references to finished tasks forever,\n"
"    # make each task remove its own reference from the set after\n"
"    # completion:\n"
"    task.add_done_callback(background_tasks.discard)"
msgstr ""
"background_tasks = set()\n"
"\n"
"for i in range(10):\n"
"    task = asyncio.create_task(some_coro(param=i))\n"
"\n"
"    # 將任務加入集合。這會建立一個強參照。\n"
"    background_tasks.add(task)\n"
"\n"
"    # 為了避免永久保留對已完成任務的參照，\n"
"    # 讓每個任務在完成後將自己的參照\n"
"    # 從集合中移除：\n"
"    task.add_done_callback(background_tasks.discard)"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:291
msgid ""
"Note that this approach never awaits the tasks, so if a task fails, its "
"exception is never retrieved and asyncio logs a \"Task exception was never "
"retrieved\" message when the task is garbage collected.  To avoid this, use :"
"class:`asyncio.TaskGroup` which keeps a strong reference to each task, "
"awaits them and propagates their exceptions::"
msgstr ""
"請注意，這種做法永遠不會等待這些任務，因此如果某個任務失敗，它的例外永遠不會"
"被取得，而 asyncio 會在該任務被垃圾回收時記錄一則 \"Task exception was never "
"retrieved\" 訊息。為了避免這種情況，請使用 :class:`asyncio.TaskGroup`，它會保"
"留對每個任務的強參照、等待它們並傳播它們的例外： ::"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:298
msgid ""
"async with asyncio.TaskGroup() as tg:\n"
"    for i in range(10):\n"
"        tg.create_task(some_coro(param=i))"
msgstr ""
"async with asyncio.TaskGroup() as tg:\n"
"    for i in range(10):\n"
"        tg.create_task(some_coro(param=i))"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:304 ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1265
msgid "Added the *name* parameter."
msgstr "新增 *name* 參數。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:307 ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1272
msgid "Added the *context* parameter."
msgstr "新增 *context* 參數。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:310
msgid "Added the *eager_start* parameter by passing on all *kwargs*."
msgstr "藉由傳遞所有 *kwargs* 來新增 *eager_start* 參數。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:315
msgid "Task cancellation"
msgstr "任務取消"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:317
msgid ""
"Tasks can easily and safely be cancelled. When a task is cancelled, :exc:"
"`asyncio.CancelledError` will be raised in the task at the next opportunity."
msgstr ""
"任務可以輕鬆且安全地被取消。當任務被取消時，:exc:`asyncio.CancelledError` 會"
"在下一個時機點於該任務中被引發。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:321
msgid ""
"It is recommended that coroutines use ``try/finally`` blocks to robustly "
"perform clean-up logic. In case :exc:`asyncio.CancelledError` is explicitly "
"caught, it should generally be propagated when clean-up is complete. :exc:"
"`asyncio.CancelledError` directly subclasses :exc:`BaseException` so most "
"code will not need to be aware of it."
msgstr ""
"建議協程使用 ``try/finally`` 區塊來穩健地執行清理邏輯。如果明確地捕捉了 :exc:"
"`asyncio.CancelledError`，通常應在清理完成後將其繼續傳播。:exc:`asyncio."
"CancelledError` 直接繼承自 :exc:`BaseException`，因此大多數程式碼不需要特別顧"
"及它。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:327
msgid ""
"The asyncio components that enable structured concurrency, like :class:"
"`asyncio.TaskGroup` and :func:`asyncio.timeout`, are implemented using "
"cancellation internally and might misbehave if a coroutine swallows :exc:"
"`asyncio.CancelledError`. Similarly, user code should not generally call :"
"meth:`uncancel <asyncio.Task.uncancel>`. However, in cases when suppressing :"
"exc:`asyncio.CancelledError` is truly desired, it is necessary to also call "
"``uncancel()`` to completely remove the cancellation state."
msgstr ""
"構成結構化並行的 asyncio 元件，例如 :class:`asyncio.TaskGroup` 和 :func:"
"`asyncio.timeout`，在內部是以取消機制實作的，如果協程吞掉了 :exc:`asyncio."
"CancelledError`，它們可能無法正常運作。同樣地，使用者程式碼通常不應該呼叫 :"
"meth:`uncancel <asyncio.Task.uncancel>`。然而，在確實需要抑制 :exc:`asyncio."
"CancelledError` 的情況下，也必須呼叫 ``uncancel()`` 來完全移除取消狀態。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:339
msgid "Task groups"
msgstr "任務群組"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:341
msgid ""
"Task groups combine a task creation API with a convenient and reliable way "
"to wait for all tasks in the group to finish."
msgstr ""
"任務群組結合了建立任務的 API，以及一種方便又可靠的方式來等待群組中的所有任務"
"完成。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:346
msgid ""
"An :ref:`asynchronous context manager <async-context-managers>` holding a "
"group of tasks. Tasks can be added to the group using :meth:`create_task`. "
"All tasks are awaited when the context manager exits."
msgstr ""
"一個持有一組任務的\\ :ref:`非同步情境管理器 <async-context-managers>`。可以使"
"用 :meth:`create_task` 將任務加入群組。當情境管理器結束時，所有任務都會被等"
"待。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:355
msgid ""
"Create a task in this task group. The signature matches that of :func:"
"`asyncio.create_task`. If the task group is inactive (e.g. not yet entered, "
"already finished, or in the process of shutting down), we will close the "
"given ``coro`` and raise :exc:`RuntimeError`."
msgstr ""
"在此任務群組中建立一個任務。其簽名與 :func:`asyncio.create_task` 的簽名相符。"
"如果任務群組不在活躍狀態（例如尚未進入、已經完成或正在關閉中），則會關閉給定"
"的 ``coro`` 並引發 :exc:`RuntimeError`。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:363
msgid "Close the given coroutine if the task group is not active."
msgstr "如果任務群組不在活躍狀態，則關閉給定的協程。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:367
msgid "Passes on all *kwargs* to :meth:`loop.create_task`"
msgstr "將所有 *kwargs* 傳遞給 :meth:`loop.create_task`"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:371
msgid ""
"Cancel the task group.  This is a non-exceptional, early exit of the task "
"group's lifetime -- useful once the group's goal has been met or its "
"services no longer needed."
msgstr ""
"取消任務群組。這是一種非例外的、提前結束任務群組生命週期的方式，適用於群組的"
"目標已經達成，或不再需要其服務的時候。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:375
msgid ""
":meth:`~asyncio.Task.cancel` will be called on any tasks in the group that "
"aren't yet done, as well as the parent (body) of the group.  The task group "
"context manager will exit *without* :exc:`asyncio.CancelledError` being "
"raised."
msgstr ""
"群組中所有尚未完成的任務，以及群組的父任務（主體），都會被呼叫 :meth:"
"`~asyncio.Task.cancel`。任務群組情境管理器結束時\\ *不會*\\ 引發 :exc:"
"`asyncio.CancelledError`。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:379
msgid ""
"If :meth:`cancel` is called before entering the task group, the group will "
"be cancelled upon entry.  This is useful for patterns where one piece of "
"code passes an unused :class:`asyncio.TaskGroup` instance to another in "
"order to have the ability to cancel anything run within the group."
msgstr ""
"如果在進入任務群組之前就呼叫了 :meth:`cancel`，群組會在進入時被取消。這對以下"
"模式很有用：一段程式碼將尚未使用的 :class:`asyncio.TaskGroup` 實例傳給另一段"
"程式碼，以便能夠取消在該群組中執行的任何東西。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:384
msgid ""
":meth:`cancel` is idempotent and may be called after the task group has "
"already exited."
msgstr ":meth:`cancel` 是冪等的，並且可以在任務群組已經結束後呼叫。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:387
msgid "Some ways to use :meth:`cancel`:"
msgstr ":meth:`cancel` 的幾種使用方式："

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:389
msgid "call it from the task group body based on some condition or event"
msgstr "在任務群組主體中根據某些條件或事件呼叫它"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:390
msgid ""
"pass the task group instance to child tasks via :meth:`create_task`, "
"allowing a child task to conditionally cancel the entire group"
msgstr ""
"透過 :meth:`create_task` 將任務群組實例傳給子任務，讓子任務能有條件地取消整個"
"群組"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:392
msgid ""
"pass the task group instance or bound :meth:`cancel` method to some other "
"task *before* opening the task group, allowing remote cancellation"
msgstr ""
"在開啟任務群組\\ *之前*，將任務群組實例或繫結的 :meth:`cancel` 方法傳給其他任"
"務，以便從其他地方取消群組"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:397 ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:565
#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:738 ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:799
#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:825 ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:862
msgid "Example::"
msgstr "範例： ::"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:399
msgid ""
"async def main():\n"
"    async with asyncio.TaskGroup() as tg:\n"
"        task1 = tg.create_task(some_coro(...))\n"
"        task2 = tg.create_task(another_coro(...))\n"
"    print(f\"Both tasks have completed now: {task1.result()}, {task2."
"result()}\")"
msgstr ""
"async def main():\n"
"    async with asyncio.TaskGroup() as tg:\n"
"        task1 = tg.create_task(some_coro(...))\n"
"        task2 = tg.create_task(another_coro(...))\n"
"    print(f\"Both tasks have completed now: {task1.result()}, {task2."
"result()}\")"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:405
msgid ""
"The ``async with`` statement will wait for all tasks in the group to finish. "
"While waiting, new tasks may still be added to the group (for example, by "
"passing ``tg`` into one of the coroutines and calling ``tg.create_task()`` "
"in that coroutine).  There is also opportunity to request termination of the "
"entire task group with ``tg.cancel()``, based on some condition. Once the "
"last task has finished and the ``async with`` block is exited, no new tasks "
"may be added to the group."
msgstr ""
"``async with`` 陳述式會等待群組中的所有任務完成。在等待期間，仍然可以將新任務"
"加入群組（例如將 ``tg`` 傳入其中一個協程，並在該協程中呼叫 ``tg."
"create_task()``）。也可以根據某些條件，透過 ``tg.cancel()`` 請求終止整個任務"
"群組。一旦最後一個任務完成且離開了 ``async with`` 區塊，就不能再將新任務加入"
"群組。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:413
msgid ""
"The first time any of the tasks belonging to the group fails with an "
"exception other than :exc:`asyncio.CancelledError`, the remaining tasks in "
"the group are cancelled. No further tasks can then be added to the group. At "
"this point, if the body of the ``async with`` statement is still active (i."
"e., :meth:`~object.__aexit__` hasn't been called yet), the task directly "
"containing the ``async with`` statement is also cancelled. The resulting :"
"exc:`asyncio.CancelledError` will interrupt an ``await``, but it will not "
"bubble out of the containing ``async with`` statement."
msgstr ""
"當群組中的任何一個任務第一次因 :exc:`asyncio.CancelledError` 以外的例外而失敗"
"時，群組中其餘的任務都會被取消。之後就不能再將任何任務加入群組。此時，如果 "
"``async with`` 陳述式的主體仍處於活躍狀態（即 :meth:`~object.__aexit__` 尚未"
"被呼叫），直接包含該 ``async with`` 陳述式的任務也會被取消。由此產生的 :exc:"
"`asyncio.CancelledError` 會中斷一個 ``await``，但它不會傳播到包含它的 "
"``async with`` 陳述式之外。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:423
msgid ""
"Once all tasks have finished, if any tasks have failed with an exception "
"other than :exc:`asyncio.CancelledError`, those exceptions are combined in "
"an :exc:`ExceptionGroup` or :exc:`BaseExceptionGroup` (as appropriate; see "
"their documentation) which is then raised."
msgstr ""
"一旦所有任務都完成，如果有任何任務因 :exc:`asyncio.CancelledError` 以外的例外"
"而失敗，這些例外會被組合成一個 :exc:`ExceptionGroup` 或 :exc:"
"`BaseExceptionGroup`\\ （視情況而定；請參閱它們的文件），然後被引發。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:430
msgid ""
"Two base exceptions are treated specially: If any task fails with :exc:"
"`KeyboardInterrupt` or :exc:`SystemExit`, the task group still cancels the "
"remaining tasks and waits for them, but then the initial :exc:"
"`KeyboardInterrupt` or :exc:`SystemExit` is re-raised instead of :exc:"
"`ExceptionGroup` or :exc:`BaseExceptionGroup`."
msgstr ""
"有兩種基底例外會被特別處理：如果任何任務因 :exc:`KeyboardInterrupt` 或 :exc:"
"`SystemExit` 而失敗，任務群組仍會取消其餘任務並等待它們，但接著會重新引發最初"
"的 :exc:`KeyboardInterrupt` 或 :exc:`SystemExit`，而不是 :exc:"
"`ExceptionGroup` 或 :exc:`BaseExceptionGroup`。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:436
msgid ""
"If the body of the ``async with`` statement exits with an exception (so :"
"meth:`~object.__aexit__` is called with an exception set), this is treated "
"the same as if one of the tasks failed: the remaining tasks are cancelled "
"and then waited for, and non-cancellation exceptions are grouped into an "
"exception group and raised. The exception passed into :meth:`~object."
"__aexit__`, unless it is :exc:`asyncio.CancelledError`, is also included in "
"the exception group. The same special case is made for :exc:"
"`KeyboardInterrupt` and :exc:`SystemExit` as in the previous paragraph. "
"There is an additional special case made only for the body of the ``async "
"with``: if it raises :exc:`GeneratorExit` and none of the other tasks raise "
"exceptions that would be reported, then the :exc:`GeneratorExit` is reraised."
msgstr ""
"如果 ``async with`` 陳述式的主體因例外而結束（因此呼叫 :meth:`~object."
"__aexit__` 時會帶有一個已設定的例外），這會被視為與其中一個任務失敗相同：其餘"
"的任務會被取消並等待，而非取消類的例外會被組合成一個例外群組並引發。傳入 :"
"meth:`~object.__aexit__` 的例外，除非它是 :exc:`asyncio.CancelledError`，否則"
"也會被包含在該例外群組中。對 :exc:`KeyboardInterrupt` 和 :exc:`SystemExit` 也"
"會做與前一段相同的特殊處理。另外還有一個只針對 ``async with`` 主體的特殊處"
"理：如果主體引發 :exc:`GeneratorExit`，且其他任務都沒有引發會被回報的例外，則"
"會重新引發該 :exc:`GeneratorExit`。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:452
msgid ""
"Task groups are careful not to mix up the internal cancellation used to "
"\"wake up\" their :meth:`~object.__aexit__` with cancellation requests for "
"the task in which they are running made by other parties. In particular, "
"when one task group is syntactically nested in another, and both experience "
"an exception in one of their child tasks simultaneously, the inner task "
"group will process its exceptions, and then the outer task group will "
"receive another cancellation and process its own exceptions."
msgstr ""
"任務群組會謹慎地區分用來「喚醒」其 :meth:`~object.__aexit__` 的內部取消，以及"
"其他方對其所在任務發出的取消請求。特別是當一個任務群組在語法上巢狀於另一個任"
"務群組中，且兩者同時在各自的某個子任務中遇到例外時，內層任務群組會處理它自己"
"的例外，然後外層任務群組會收到另一個取消並處理它自己的例外。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:460
msgid ""
"In the case where a task group is cancelled externally and also must raise "
"an :exc:`ExceptionGroup`, it will call the parent task's :meth:`~asyncio."
"Task.cancel` method. This ensures that a :exc:`asyncio.CancelledError` will "
"be raised at the next :keyword:`await`, so the cancellation is not lost."
msgstr ""
"在任務群組被外部取消且同時必須引發 :exc:`ExceptionGroup` 的情況下，它會呼叫父"
"任務的 :meth:`~asyncio.Task.cancel` 方法。這能確保在下一個 :keyword:`await` "
"處引發 :exc:`asyncio.CancelledError`，使取消不會遺失。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:466
msgid ""
"Task groups preserve the cancellation count reported by :meth:`asyncio.Task."
"cancelling`."
msgstr "任務群組會保留由 :meth:`asyncio.Task.cancelling` 回報的取消計數。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:471
msgid ""
"Improved handling of simultaneous internal and external cancellations and "
"correct preservation of cancellation counts."
msgstr "改進了對同時發生的內部與外部取消的處理，並能正確保留取消計數。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:476
msgid "Addition of the special case for :exc:`GeneratorExit`."
msgstr "新增針對 :exc:`GeneratorExit` 的特殊處理。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:479
msgid "Sleeping"
msgstr "休眠"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:484
msgid "Block for *delay* seconds."
msgstr "阻塞 *delay* 秒。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:486
msgid ""
"If *result* is provided, it is returned to the caller when the coroutine "
"completes."
msgstr "如果有提供 *result*，則會在協程完成時將其回傳給呼叫者。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:489
msgid ""
"``sleep()`` always suspends the current task, allowing other tasks to run."
msgstr "``sleep()`` 總是會暫停目前的任務，讓其他任務得以執行。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:492
msgid ""
"Setting the delay to 0 provides an optimized path to allow other tasks to "
"run. This can be used by long-running functions to avoid blocking the event "
"loop for the full duration of the function call."
msgstr ""
"將 delay 設為 0 會提供一條最佳化的路徑，讓其他任務得以執行。長時間執行的函式"
"可以藉此避免在函式呼叫的整段期間阻塞事件迴圈。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:498
msgid ""
"Example of coroutine displaying the current date every second for 5 seconds::"
msgstr "一個每秒顯示目前日期、持續 5 秒的協程範例： ::"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:501
msgid ""
"import asyncio\n"
"import datetime as dt\n"
"\n"
"async def display_date():\n"
"    loop = asyncio.get_running_loop()\n"
"    end_time = loop.time() + 5.0\n"
"    while True:\n"
"        print(dt.datetime.now())\n"
"        if (loop.time() + 1.0) >= end_time:\n"
"            break\n"
"        await asyncio.sleep(1)\n"
"\n"
"asyncio.run(display_date())"
msgstr ""
"import asyncio\n"
"import datetime as dt\n"
"\n"
"async def display_date():\n"
"    loop = asyncio.get_running_loop()\n"
"    end_time = loop.time() + 5.0\n"
"    while True:\n"
"        print(dt.datetime.now())\n"
"        if (loop.time() + 1.0) >= end_time:\n"
"            break\n"
"        await asyncio.sleep(1)\n"
"\n"
"asyncio.run(display_date())"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:516 ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:614
#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:713 ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:887
#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:949 ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1010
msgid "Removed the *loop* parameter."
msgstr "移除 *loop* 參數。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:519
msgid "Raises :exc:`ValueError` if *delay* is :data:`~math.nan`."
msgstr "如果 *delay* 是 :data:`~math.nan`，則引發 :exc:`ValueError`。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:524
msgid "Running tasks concurrently"
msgstr "並行執行任務"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:528
msgid ""
"Run :ref:`awaitable objects <asyncio-awaitables>` in the *aws* sequence "
"*concurrently*."
msgstr ""
"*並行地*\\ 執行 *aws* 序列中的\\ :ref:`可等待物件 <asyncio-awaitables>`。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:531
msgid ""
"If any awaitable in *aws* is a coroutine, it is automatically scheduled as a "
"Task."
msgstr "如果 *aws* 中的任何可等待物件是協程，它會自動被排程為 Task。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:534
msgid ""
"If all awaitables are completed successfully, the result is an aggregate "
"list of returned values.  The order of result values corresponds to the "
"order of awaitables in *aws*."
msgstr ""
"如果所有可等待物件都成功完成，結果會是由回傳值彙總而成的串列。結果值的順序與 "
"*aws* 中可等待物件的順序相對應。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:538
msgid ""
"If *return_exceptions* is ``False`` (default), the first raised exception is "
"immediately propagated to the task that awaits on ``gather()``.  Other "
"awaitables in the *aws* sequence **won't be cancelled** and will continue to "
"run."
msgstr ""
"如果 *return_exceptions* 為 ``False``\\ （預設值），第一個被引發的例外會立即"
"傳播到等待 ``gather()`` 的任務。*aws* 序列中的其他可等待物件\\ **不會被取消"
"**，並會繼續執行。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:543
msgid ""
"If *return_exceptions* is ``True``, exceptions are treated the same as "
"successful results, and aggregated in the result list."
msgstr ""
"如果 *return_exceptions* 為 ``True``，例外會被視為與成功的結果相同，並被彙總"
"到結果串列中。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:546
msgid ""
"If ``gather()`` is *cancelled*, all submitted awaitables (that have not "
"completed yet) are also *cancelled*."
msgstr ""
"如果 ``gather()`` 被\\ *取消*，所有已提交且尚未完成的可等待物件也都會被\\ *取"
"消*。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:549
msgid ""
"If any Task or Future from the *aws* sequence is *cancelled*, it is treated "
"as if it raised :exc:`CancelledError` -- the ``gather()`` call is **not** "
"cancelled in this case.  This is to prevent the cancellation of one "
"submitted Task/Future to cause other Tasks/Futures to be cancelled."
msgstr ""
"如果 *aws* 序列中的任何 Task 或 Future 被\\ *取消*，它會被視為引發了 :exc:"
"`CancelledError` -- 在這種情況下 ``gather()`` 呼叫\\ **不會**\\ 被取消。這是"
"為了防止某個已提交的 Task/Future 被取消時，導致其他 Task/Future 也被取消。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:556
msgid ""
"A new alternative to create and run tasks concurrently and wait for their "
"completion is :class:`asyncio.TaskGroup`. *TaskGroup* provides stronger "
"safety guarantees than *gather* for scheduling a nesting of subtasks: if a "
"task (or a subtask, a task scheduled by a task) raises an exception, "
"*TaskGroup* will, while *gather* will not, cancel the remaining scheduled "
"tasks."
msgstr ""
":class:`asyncio.TaskGroup` 是建立任務、並行執行任務並等待其完成的新替代方案。"
"在為巢狀的子任務排程時，*TaskGroup* 提供比 *gather* 更強的安全保證：如果某個"
"任務（或子任務，即由某個任務所排程的任務）引發例外，*TaskGroup* 會取消其餘已"
"排程的任務，而 *gather* 則不會。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:567
msgid ""
"import asyncio\n"
"\n"
"async def factorial(name, number):\n"
"    f = 1\n"
"    for i in range(2, number + 1):\n"
"        print(f\"Task {name}: Compute factorial({number}), currently i={i}..."
"\")\n"
"        await asyncio.sleep(1)\n"
"        f *= i\n"
"    print(f\"Task {name}: factorial({number}) = {f}\")\n"
"    return f\n"
"\n"
"async def main():\n"
"    # Schedule three calls *concurrently*:\n"
"    L = await asyncio.gather(\n"
"        factorial(\"A\", 2),\n"
"        factorial(\"B\", 3),\n"
"        factorial(\"C\", 4),\n"
"    )\n"
"    print(L)\n"
"\n"
"asyncio.run(main())\n"
"\n"
"# Expected output:\n"
"#\n"
"#     Task A: Compute factorial(2), currently i=2...\n"
"#     Task B: Compute factorial(3), currently i=2...\n"
"#     Task C: Compute factorial(4), currently i=2...\n"
"#     Task A: factorial(2) = 2\n"
"#     Task B: Compute factorial(3), currently i=3...\n"
"#     Task C: Compute factorial(4), currently i=3...\n"
"#     Task B: factorial(3) = 6\n"
"#     Task C: Compute factorial(4), currently i=4...\n"
"#     Task C: factorial(4) = 24\n"
"#     [2, 6, 24]"
msgstr ""
"import asyncio\n"
"\n"
"async def factorial(name, number):\n"
"    f = 1\n"
"    for i in range(2, number + 1):\n"
"        print(f\"Task {name}: Compute factorial({number}), currently i={i}..."
"\")\n"
"        await asyncio.sleep(1)\n"
"        f *= i\n"
"    print(f\"Task {name}: factorial({number}) = {f}\")\n"
"    return f\n"
"\n"
"async def main():\n"
"    # *並行地*排程三個呼叫：\n"
"    L = await asyncio.gather(\n"
"        factorial(\"A\", 2),\n"
"        factorial(\"B\", 3),\n"
"        factorial(\"C\", 4),\n"
"    )\n"
"    print(L)\n"
"\n"
"asyncio.run(main())\n"
"\n"
"# 預期的輸出：\n"
"#\n"
"#     Task A: Compute factorial(2), currently i=2...\n"
"#     Task B: Compute factorial(3), currently i=2...\n"
"#     Task C: Compute factorial(4), currently i=2...\n"
"#     Task A: factorial(2) = 2\n"
"#     Task B: Compute factorial(3), currently i=3...\n"
"#     Task C: Compute factorial(4), currently i=3...\n"
"#     Task B: factorial(3) = 6\n"
"#     Task C: Compute factorial(4), currently i=4...\n"
"#     Task C: factorial(4) = 24\n"
"#     [2, 6, 24]"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:603
msgid ""
"If *return_exceptions* is false, cancelling gather() after it has been "
"marked done won't cancel any submitted awaitables. For instance, gather can "
"be marked done after propagating an exception to the caller, therefore, "
"calling ``gather.cancel()`` after catching an exception (raised by one of "
"the awaitables) from gather won't cancel any other awaitables."
msgstr ""
"如果 *return_exceptions* 為 false，在 gather() 被標記為已完成之後取消它，並不"
"會取消任何已提交的可等待物件。例如，gather 可能在將例外傳播給呼叫者之後就被標"
"記為已完成，因此，在從 gather 捕捉到（由其中一個可等待物件引發的）例外後呼叫 "
"``gather.cancel()``，並不會取消任何其他可等待物件。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:610
msgid ""
"If the *gather* itself is cancelled, the cancellation is propagated "
"regardless of *return_exceptions*."
msgstr ""
"如果 *gather* 本身被取消，無論 *return_exceptions* 為何，取消都會被傳播。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:617
msgid ""
"Deprecation warning is emitted if no positional arguments are provided or "
"not all positional arguments are Future-like objects and there is no running "
"event loop."
msgstr ""
"如果沒有提供位置引數，或並非所有位置引數都是類 Future 物件，且沒有正在執行的"
"事件迴圈，則會發出棄用警告。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:626
msgid "Eager task factory"
msgstr "急切任務工廠"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:630
msgid "A task factory for eager task execution."
msgstr "用於急切執行任務 (eager task execution) 的任務工廠。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:632
msgid ""
"When using this factory (via :meth:`loop.set_task_factory(asyncio."
"eager_task_factory) <loop.set_task_factory>`), coroutines begin execution "
"synchronously during :class:`Task` construction. Tasks are only scheduled on "
"the event loop if they block. This can be a performance improvement as the "
"overhead of loop scheduling is avoided for coroutines that complete "
"synchronously."
msgstr ""
"使用此工廠時（透過 :meth:`loop.set_task_factory(asyncio.eager_task_factory) "
"<loop.set_task_factory>`），協程會在 :class:`Task` 建構期間同步地開始執行。只"
"有在 Task 阻塞時，才會被排程到事件迴圈上。對於同步完成的協程，這能避免迴圈排"
"程的開銷，因此可以提升效能。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:638
msgid ""
"A common example where this is beneficial is coroutines which employ caching "
"or memoization to avoid actual I/O when possible."
msgstr ""
"常見的受益例子是那些使用快取或記憶化 (memoization)、盡可能避免實際 I/O 的協"
"程。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:643
msgid ""
"Immediate execution of the coroutine is a semantic change. If the coroutine "
"returns or raises, the task is never scheduled to the event loop. If the "
"coroutine execution blocks, the task is scheduled to the event loop. This "
"change may introduce behavior changes to existing applications. For example, "
"the application's task execution order is likely to change."
msgstr ""
"立即執行協程是一項語意上的改變。如果協程回傳或引發例外，該任務永遠不會被排程"
"到事件迴圈。如果協程的執行發生阻塞，該任務才會被排程到事件迴圈。這項改變可能"
"會讓現有的應用程式產生行為上的變化。例如，應用程式的任務執行順序很可能會改"
"變。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:654
msgid ""
"Create an eager task factory, similar to :func:`eager_task_factory`, using "
"the provided *custom_task_constructor* when creating a new task instead of "
"the default :class:`Task`."
msgstr ""
"建立一個類似於 :func:`eager_task_factory` 的急切任務工廠，在建立新任務時使用"
"所提供的 *custom_task_constructor*，而不是預設的 :class:`Task`。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:658
msgid ""
"*custom_task_constructor* must be a *callable* with the signature matching "
"the signature of :class:`Task.__init__ <Task>`. The callable must return a :"
"class:`asyncio.Task`-compatible object."
msgstr ""
"*custom_task_constructor* 必須是一個\\ *可呼叫物件*，其簽名須與 :class:`Task."
"__init__ <Task>` 的簽名相符。該可呼叫物件必須回傳一個與 :class:`asyncio."
"Task` 相容的物件。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:662
msgid ""
"This function returns a *callable* intended to be used as a task factory of "
"an event loop via :meth:`loop.set_task_factory(factory) <loop."
"set_task_factory>`)."
msgstr ""
"此函式會回傳一個\\ *可呼叫物件*，用於透過 :meth:`loop."
"set_task_factory(factory) <loop.set_task_factory>` 作為事件迴圈的任務工廠。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:669
msgid "Shielding from cancellation"
msgstr "防止被取消"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:673
msgid ""
"Protect an :ref:`awaitable object <asyncio-awaitables>` from being :meth:"
"`cancelled <Task.cancel>`."
msgstr ""
"保護一個\\ :ref:`可等待物件 <asyncio-awaitables>`\\ 不被\\ :meth:`取消 <Task."
"cancel>`。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:676
msgid "If *aw* is a coroutine it is automatically scheduled as a Task."
msgstr "如果 *aw* 是一個協程，它會自動被排程為 Task。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:678
msgid "The statement::"
msgstr "以下陳述式： ::"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:680
msgid ""
"task = asyncio.create_task(something())\n"
"res = await shield(task)"
msgstr ""
"task = asyncio.create_task(something())\n"
"res = await shield(task)"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:683
msgid "is equivalent to::"
msgstr "等價於： ::"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:685
msgid "res = await something()"
msgstr "res = await something()"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:687
msgid ""
"*except* that if the coroutine containing it is cancelled, the Task running "
"in ``something()`` is not cancelled.  From the point of view of "
"``something()``, the cancellation did not happen. Although its caller is "
"still cancelled, so the \"await\" expression still raises a :exc:"
"`CancelledError`."
msgstr ""
"*不同之處*\\ 在於，如果包含它的協程被取消，在 ``something()`` 中執行的 Task "
"並不會被取消。從 ``something()`` 的角度來看，取消並沒有發生。但它的呼叫者仍然"
"會被取消，因此 \"await\" 運算式仍然會引發 :exc:`CancelledError`。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:693
msgid ""
"If ``something()`` is cancelled by other means (i.e. from within itself) "
"that would also cancel ``shield()``."
msgstr ""
"如果 ``something()`` 被其他方式取消（也就是從它自身內部取消），那也會取消 "
"``shield()``。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:696
msgid ""
"If it is desired to completely ignore cancellation (not recommended) the "
"``shield()`` function should be combined with a try/except clause, as "
"follows::"
msgstr ""
"如果希望完全忽略取消（不建議），則應將 ``shield()`` 函式與 try/except 子句結"
"合使用，如下所示： ::"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:700
msgid ""
"task = asyncio.create_task(something())\n"
"try:\n"
"    res = await shield(task)\n"
"except CancelledError:\n"
"    res = None"
msgstr ""
"task = asyncio.create_task(something())\n"
"try:\n"
"    res = await shield(task)\n"
"except CancelledError:\n"
"    res = None"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:708
msgid ""
"Save a reference to tasks passed to this function, to avoid a task "
"disappearing mid-execution. The event loop only keeps weak references to "
"tasks. A task that isn't referenced elsewhere may get garbage collected at "
"any time, even before it's done."
msgstr ""
"請保存傳遞給此函式之任務的參照，以避免任務在執行途中消失。事件迴圈只會保留對"
"任務的弱參照。沒有在其他地方被參照的任務可能隨時被垃圾回收，甚至在它完成之"
"前。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:716
msgid ""
"Deprecation warning is emitted if *aw* is not Future-like object and there "
"is no running event loop."
msgstr ""
"如果 *aw* 不是類 Future 物件，且沒有正在執行的事件迴圈，則會發出棄用警告。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:722
msgid "Timeouts"
msgstr "超時"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:726
msgid ""
"Return an :ref:`asynchronous context manager <async-context-managers>` that "
"can be used to limit the amount of time spent waiting on something."
msgstr ""
"回傳一個\\ :ref:`非同步情境管理器 <async-context-managers>`，可用來限制等待某"
"件事所花費的時間。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:730
msgid ""
"*delay* can either be ``None``, or a float/int number of seconds to wait. If "
"*delay* is ``None``, no time limit will be applied; this can be useful if "
"the delay is unknown when the context manager is created."
msgstr ""
"*delay* 可以是 ``None``，或是以 float/int 表示的等待秒數。如果 *delay* 是 "
"``None``，則不會套用時間限制；當建立情境管理器時還不知道延遲時間，這會很有"
"用。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:735
msgid ""
"In either case, the context manager can be rescheduled after creation using :"
"meth:`Timeout.reschedule`."
msgstr ""
"無論是哪種情況，情境管理器都可以在建立後使用 :meth:`Timeout.reschedule` 重新"
"排程。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:740
msgid ""
"async def main():\n"
"    async with asyncio.timeout(10):\n"
"        await long_running_task()"
msgstr ""
"async def main():\n"
"    async with asyncio.timeout(10):\n"
"        await long_running_task()"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:744
msgid ""
"If ``long_running_task`` takes more than 10 seconds to complete, the context "
"manager will cancel the current task and handle the resulting :exc:`asyncio."
"CancelledError` internally, transforming it into a :exc:`TimeoutError` which "
"can be caught and handled."
msgstr ""
"如果 ``long_running_task`` 花費超過 10 秒才完成，情境管理器會取消目前的任務，"
"並在內部處理由此產生的 :exc:`asyncio.CancelledError`，將其轉換為可被捕捉和處"
"理的 :exc:`TimeoutError`。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:751
msgid ""
"The :func:`asyncio.timeout` context manager is what transforms the :exc:"
"`asyncio.CancelledError` into a :exc:`TimeoutError`, which means the :exc:"
"`TimeoutError` can only be caught *outside* of the context manager."
msgstr ""
":func:`asyncio.timeout` 情境管理器負責將 :exc:`asyncio.CancelledError` 轉換"
"為 :exc:`TimeoutError`，這代表 :exc:`TimeoutError` 只能在情境管理器的\\ *外部"
"*\\ 被捕捉。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:756
msgid "Example of catching :exc:`TimeoutError`::"
msgstr "捕捉 :exc:`TimeoutError` 的範例： ::"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:758
msgid ""
"async def main():\n"
"    try:\n"
"        async with asyncio.timeout(10):\n"
"            await long_running_task()\n"
"    except TimeoutError:\n"
"        print(\"The long operation timed out, but we've handled it.\")\n"
"\n"
"    print(\"This statement will run regardless.\")"
msgstr ""
"async def main():\n"
"    try:\n"
"        async with asyncio.timeout(10):\n"
"            await long_running_task()\n"
"    except TimeoutError:\n"
"        print(\"The long operation timed out, but we've handled it.\")\n"
"\n"
"    print(\"This statement will run regardless.\")"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:767
msgid ""
"The context manager produced by :func:`asyncio.timeout` can be rescheduled "
"to a different deadline and inspected."
msgstr ""
"由 :func:`asyncio.timeout` 產生的情境管理器可以被重新排程到不同的截止時間，也"
"可以被檢查。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:772
msgid ""
"An :ref:`asynchronous context manager <async-context-managers>` for "
"cancelling overdue coroutines."
msgstr ""
"一個用於取消逾期協程的\\ :ref:`非同步情境管理器 <async-context-managers>`。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:775
msgid ""
"Prefer using :func:`asyncio.timeout` or :func:`asyncio.timeout_at` rather "
"than instantiating :class:`!Timeout` directly."
msgstr ""
"建議使用 :func:`asyncio.timeout` 或 :func:`asyncio.timeout_at`，而不是直接實"
"例化 :class:`!Timeout`。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:778
msgid ""
"``when`` should be an absolute time at which the context should time out, as "
"measured by the event loop's clock:"
msgstr "``when`` 應為該情境管理器超時的絕對時間，以事件迴圈的時鐘為準："

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:781
msgid "If ``when`` is ``None``, the timeout will never trigger."
msgstr "如果 ``when`` 是 ``None``，超時永遠不會觸發。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:782
msgid ""
"If ``when < loop.time()``, the timeout will trigger on the next iteration of "
"the event loop."
msgstr "如果 ``when < loop.time()``，超時會在事件迴圈的下一次疊代時觸發。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:787
msgid ""
"Return the current deadline, or ``None`` if the current deadline is not set."
msgstr "回傳目前的截止時間，如果目前未設定截止時間則回傳 ``None``。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:792
msgid "Reschedule the timeout."
msgstr "重新排程超時。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:796
msgid "Return whether the context manager has exceeded its deadline (expired)."
msgstr "回傳情境管理器是否已超過其截止時間（已過期）。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:801
msgid ""
"async def main():\n"
"    try:\n"
"        # We do not know the timeout when starting, so we pass ``None``.\n"
"        async with asyncio.timeout(None) as cm:\n"
"            # We know the timeout now, so we reschedule it.\n"
"            new_deadline = get_running_loop().time() + 10\n"
"            cm.reschedule(new_deadline)\n"
"\n"
"            await long_running_task()\n"
"    except TimeoutError:\n"
"        pass\n"
"\n"
"    if cm.expired():\n"
"        print(\"Looks like we haven't finished on time.\")"
msgstr ""
"async def main():\n"
"    try:\n"
"        # 開始時還不知道超時時間，所以傳入 ``None``。\n"
"        async with asyncio.timeout(None) as cm:\n"
"            # 現在知道超時時間了，所以重新排程。\n"
"            new_deadline = get_running_loop().time() + 10\n"
"            cm.reschedule(new_deadline)\n"
"\n"
"            await long_running_task()\n"
"    except TimeoutError:\n"
"        pass\n"
"\n"
"    if cm.expired():\n"
"        print(\"Looks like we haven't finished on time.\")"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:816
msgid "Timeout context managers can be safely nested."
msgstr "超時情境管理器可以安全地巢狀使用。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:822
msgid ""
"Similar to :func:`asyncio.timeout`, except *when* is the absolute time to "
"stop waiting, or ``None``."
msgstr ""
"類似於 :func:`asyncio.timeout`，不同之處在於 *when* 是停止等待的絕對時間，或"
"是 ``None``。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:827
msgid ""
"async def main():\n"
"    loop = get_running_loop()\n"
"    deadline = loop.time() + 20\n"
"    try:\n"
"        async with asyncio.timeout_at(deadline):\n"
"            await long_running_task()\n"
"    except TimeoutError:\n"
"        print(\"The long operation timed out, but we've handled it.\")\n"
"\n"
"    print(\"This statement will run regardless.\")"
msgstr ""
"async def main():\n"
"    loop = get_running_loop()\n"
"    deadline = loop.time() + 20\n"
"    try:\n"
"        async with asyncio.timeout_at(deadline):\n"
"            await long_running_task()\n"
"    except TimeoutError:\n"
"        print(\"The long operation timed out, but we've handled it.\")\n"
"\n"
"    print(\"This statement will run regardless.\")"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:843
msgid ""
"Wait for the *aw* :ref:`awaitable <asyncio-awaitables>` to complete with a "
"timeout."
msgstr "等待 *aw* :ref:`可等待物件 <asyncio-awaitables>`\\ 完成，並設有超時。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:846
msgid ""
"*timeout* can either be ``None`` or a float or int number of seconds to wait "
"for.  If *timeout* is ``None``, block until the future completes."
msgstr ""
"*timeout* 可以是 ``None``，或是以 float 或 int 表示的等待秒數。如果 "
"*timeout* 是 ``None``，則會阻塞直到 future 完成。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:850
msgid "If a timeout occurs, it cancels *aw* and raises :exc:`TimeoutError`."
msgstr "如果發生超時，它會取消 *aw* 並引發 :exc:`TimeoutError`。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:852
msgid "To prevent *aw* from being cancelled, wrap it in :func:`shield`."
msgstr "要防止 *aw* 被取消，請將它包裝在 :func:`shield` 中。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:854
msgid ""
"The function will wait until the future is actually cancelled, so the total "
"wait time may exceed the *timeout*. If an exception happens during "
"cancellation, it is propagated."
msgstr ""
"此函式會等待直到 future 真正被取消，因此總等待時間可能會超過 *timeout*。如果"
"在取消期間發生例外，該例外會被傳播。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:858
msgid "If the wait is cancelled, the future *aw* is also cancelled."
msgstr "如果等待被取消，future *aw* 也會被取消。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:864
msgid ""
"async def eternity():\n"
"    # Sleep for one hour\n"
"    await asyncio.sleep(3600)\n"
"    print('yay!')\n"
"\n"
"async def main():\n"
"    # Wait for at most 1 second\n"
"    try:\n"
"        await asyncio.wait_for(eternity(), timeout=1.0)\n"
"    except TimeoutError:\n"
"        print('timeout!')\n"
"\n"
"asyncio.run(main())\n"
"\n"
"# Expected output:\n"
"#\n"
"#     timeout!"
msgstr ""
"async def eternity():\n"
"    # 休眠一小時\n"
"    await asyncio.sleep(3600)\n"
"    print('yay!')\n"
"\n"
"async def main():\n"
"    # 最多等待 1 秒\n"
"    try:\n"
"        await asyncio.wait_for(eternity(), timeout=1.0)\n"
"    except TimeoutError:\n"
"        print('timeout!')\n"
"\n"
"asyncio.run(main())\n"
"\n"
"# 預期的輸出：\n"
"#\n"
"#     timeout!"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:882
msgid ""
"When *aw* is cancelled due to a timeout, ``wait_for`` waits for *aw* to be "
"cancelled.  Previously, it raised :exc:`TimeoutError` immediately."
msgstr ""
"當 *aw* 因超時而被取消時，``wait_for`` 會等待 *aw* 被取消。先前它會立即引發 :"
"exc:`TimeoutError`。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:890
msgid "Raises :exc:`TimeoutError` instead of :exc:`asyncio.TimeoutError`."
msgstr "引發 :exc:`TimeoutError` 而不是 :exc:`asyncio.TimeoutError`。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:893
msgid ""
"Implemented using :func:`asyncio.timeout`, a coroutine passed as *aw* is no "
"longer wrapped in a :class:`Task` when *timeout* is positive."
msgstr ""
"改以 :func:`asyncio.timeout` 實作；當 *timeout* 為正數時，作為 *aw* 傳入的協"
"程不再被包裝在 :class:`Task` 中。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:899
msgid "Waiting primitives"
msgstr "等待原語"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:904
msgid ""
"Run :class:`~asyncio.Future` and :class:`~asyncio.Task` instances in the "
"*aws* iterable concurrently and block until the condition specified by "
"*return_when*."
msgstr ""
"並行地執行 *aws* 可疊代物件中的 :class:`~asyncio.Future` 和 :class:`~asyncio."
"Task` 實例，並阻塞直到滿足 *return_when* 所指定的條件。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:908
msgid "The *aws* iterable must not be empty."
msgstr "*aws* 可疊代物件不得為空。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:910
msgid "Returns two sets of Tasks/Futures: ``(done, pending)``."
msgstr "回傳兩個 Task/Future 的集合：``(done, pending)``。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:912
msgid "Usage::"
msgstr "用法： ::"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:914
msgid "done, pending = await asyncio.wait(aws)"
msgstr "done, pending = await asyncio.wait(aws)"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:916
msgid ""
"*timeout* (a float or int), if specified, can be used to control the maximum "
"number of seconds to wait before returning."
msgstr "*timeout*\\ （float 或 int）若有指定，可用來控制回傳前最多等待的秒數。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:919
msgid ""
"Note that this function does not raise :exc:`TimeoutError`. Futures or Tasks "
"that aren't done when the timeout occurs are simply returned in the second "
"set."
msgstr ""
"請注意，此函式不會引發 :exc:`TimeoutError`。發生超時時尚未完成的 Future 或 "
"Task 會直接在第二個集合中回傳。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:923
msgid ""
"*return_when* indicates when this function should return.  It must be one of "
"the following constants:"
msgstr "*return_when* 指定此函式應在何時回傳。它必須是以下常數之一："

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:929
msgid "Constant"
msgstr "常數"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:930
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:933
msgid "The function will return when any future finishes or is cancelled."
msgstr "當任何 future 完成或被取消時，該函式就會回傳。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:936
msgid ""
"The function will return when any future finishes by raising an exception. "
"If no future raises an exception then it is equivalent to :const:"
"`ALL_COMPLETED`."
msgstr ""
"該函式會在任何 future 因引發例外而結束時回傳。如果沒有任何 future 引發例外，"
"則等同於 :const:`ALL_COMPLETED`。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:941
msgid "The function will return when all futures finish or are cancelled."
msgstr "當所有 future 都完成或被取消時，該函式才會回傳。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:943
msgid ""
"Unlike :func:`~asyncio.wait_for`, ``wait()`` does not cancel the futures "
"when a timeout occurs."
msgstr ""
"與 :func:`~asyncio.wait_for` 不同，``wait()`` 在發生超時時不會取消 future。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:946
msgid ""
"If ``wait()`` is cancelled, the futures in *aws* are not cancelled and "
"continue to run."
msgstr "如果 ``wait()`` 被取消，*aws* 中的 future 不會被取消，並會繼續執行。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:952
msgid "Passing coroutine objects to ``wait()`` directly is forbidden."
msgstr "禁止直接將協程物件傳給 ``wait()``。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:955 ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1017
msgid "Added support for generators yielding tasks."
msgstr "新增對 yield 任務之產生器的支援。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:961
msgid ""
"Run :ref:`awaitable objects <asyncio-awaitables>` in the *aws* iterable "
"concurrently. The returned object can be iterated to obtain the results of "
"the awaitables as they finish."
msgstr ""
"並行地執行 *aws* 可疊代物件中的\\ :ref:`可等待物件 <asyncio-awaitables>`。可"
"以疊代回傳的物件，以在可等待物件完成時取得它們的結果。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:965
msgid ""
"The object returned by ``as_completed()`` can be iterated as an :term:"
"`asynchronous iterator` or a plain :term:`iterator`. When asynchronous "
"iteration is used, the originally-supplied awaitables are yielded if they "
"are tasks or futures. This makes it easy to correlate previously-scheduled "
"tasks with their results. Example::"
msgstr ""
"``as_completed()`` 回傳的物件可以作為\\ :term:`非同步疊代器 <asynchronous "
"iterator>`\\ 或一般的\\ :term:`疊代器 <iterator>`\\ 來疊代。使用非同步疊代"
"時，如果原先提供的可等待物件是任務或 future，就會直接 yield 它們。這讓先前已"
"排程的任務能輕鬆地與其結果對應起來。範例： ::"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:971
msgid ""
"ipv4_connect = create_task(open_connection(\"127.0.0.1\", 80))\n"
"ipv6_connect = create_task(open_connection(\"::1\", 80))\n"
"tasks = [ipv4_connect, ipv6_connect]\n"
"\n"
"async for earliest_connect in as_completed(tasks):\n"
"    # earliest_connect is done. The result can be obtained by\n"
"    # awaiting it or calling earliest_connect.result()\n"
"    reader, writer = await earliest_connect\n"
"\n"
"    if earliest_connect is ipv6_connect:\n"
"        print(\"IPv6 connection established.\")\n"
"    else:\n"
"        print(\"IPv4 connection established.\")"
msgstr ""
"ipv4_connect = create_task(open_connection(\"127.0.0.1\", 80))\n"
"ipv6_connect = create_task(open_connection(\"::1\", 80))\n"
"tasks = [ipv4_connect, ipv6_connect]\n"
"\n"
"async for earliest_connect in as_completed(tasks):\n"
"    # earliest_connect 已完成。可以透過等待它\n"
"    # 或呼叫 earliest_connect.result() 來取得結果\n"
"    reader, writer = await earliest_connect\n"
"\n"
"    if earliest_connect is ipv6_connect:\n"
"        print(\"IPv6 connection established.\")\n"
"    else:\n"
"        print(\"IPv4 connection established.\")"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:985
msgid ""
"During asynchronous iteration, implicitly-created tasks will be yielded for "
"supplied awaitables that aren't tasks or futures."
msgstr ""
"在非同步疊代期間，若所提供的可等待物件不是任務或 future，則會 yield 為其隱式"
"建立的任務。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:988
msgid ""
"When used as a plain iterator, each iteration yields a new coroutine that "
"returns the result or raises the exception of the next completed awaitable. "
"This pattern is compatible with Python versions older than 3.13::"
msgstr ""
"作為一般疊代器使用時，每次疊代都會 yield 一個新的協程，該協程會回傳下一個完成"
"之可等待物件的結果，或引發其例外。此模式與 3.13 之前的 Python 版本相容： ::"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:992
msgid ""
"ipv4_connect = create_task(open_connection(\"127.0.0.1\", 80))\n"
"ipv6_connect = create_task(open_connection(\"::1\", 80))\n"
"tasks = [ipv4_connect, ipv6_connect]\n"
"\n"
"for next_connect in as_completed(tasks):\n"
"    # next_connect is not one of the original task objects. It must be\n"
"    # awaited to obtain the result value or raise the exception of the\n"
"    # awaitable that finishes next.\n"
"    reader, writer = await next_connect"
msgstr ""
"ipv4_connect = create_task(open_connection(\"127.0.0.1\", 80))\n"
"ipv6_connect = create_task(open_connection(\"::1\", 80))\n"
"tasks = [ipv4_connect, ipv6_connect]\n"
"\n"
"for next_connect in as_completed(tasks):\n"
"    # next_connect 並不是原本的任務物件之一。必須等待它，\n"
"    # 才能取得下一個完成之可等待物件的結果值，\n"
"    # 或引發其例外。\n"
"    reader, writer = await next_connect"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1002
msgid ""
"A :exc:`TimeoutError` is raised if the timeout occurs before all awaitables "
"are done. This is raised by the ``async for`` loop during asynchronous "
"iteration or by the coroutines yielded during plain iteration."
msgstr ""
"如果在所有可等待物件完成前發生超時，則會引發 :exc:`TimeoutError`。在非同步疊"
"代期間，這會由 ``async for`` 迴圈引發；在一般疊代期間，則由所 yield 的協程引"
"發。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1006
msgid ""
"``as_completed()`` does not cancel the tasks running the supplied "
"awaitables: if a timeout occurs or the iteration is cancelled, the remaining "
"tasks continue to run."
msgstr ""
"``as_completed()`` 不會取消執行所提供之可等待物件的任務：如果發生超時或疊代被"
"取消，其餘的任務會繼續執行。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1013
msgid ""
"Deprecation warning is emitted if not all awaitable objects in the *aws* "
"iterable are Future-like objects and there is no running event loop."
msgstr ""
"如果 *aws* 可疊代物件中並非所有可等待物件都是類 Future 物件，且沒有正在執行的"
"事件迴圈，則會發出棄用警告。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1020
msgid ""
"The result can now be used as either an :term:`asynchronous iterator` or as "
"a plain :term:`iterator` (previously it was only a plain iterator)."
msgstr ""
"現在結果可以作為\\ :term:`非同步疊代器 <asynchronous iterator>`\\ 或一般的"
"\\ :term:`疊代器 <iterator>`\\ 使用（先前只能作為一般疊代器）。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1026
msgid "Running in threads"
msgstr "在執行緒中執行"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1031
msgid "Asynchronously run function *func* in a separate thread."
msgstr "在另一個執行緒中非同步地執行函式 *func*。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1033
msgid ""
"Any \\*args and \\*\\*kwargs supplied for this function are directly passed "
"to *func*. Also, the current :class:`contextvars.Context` is propagated, "
"allowing context variables from the event loop thread to be accessed in the "
"separate thread."
msgstr ""
"提供給此函式的任何 \\*args 和 \\*\\*kwargs 都會直接傳遞給 *func*。此外，目前"
"的 :class:`contextvars.Context` 也會被傳播，讓事件迴圈執行緒中的情境變數可以"
"在另一個執行緒中被存取。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1038
msgid ""
"Return a coroutine that can be awaited to get the eventual result of *func*."
msgstr "回傳一個協程，可以等待它以取得 *func* 的最終結果。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1040
msgid ""
"This coroutine function is primarily intended to be used for executing IO-"
"bound functions/methods that would otherwise block the event loop if they "
"were run in the main thread. For example::"
msgstr ""
"這個協程函式主要用於執行 IO 密集型 (IO-bound) 的函式/方法，這些函式/方法若在"
"主執行緒中執行，則會阻塞事件迴圈。例如： ::"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1044
msgid ""
"def blocking_io():\n"
"    print(f\"start blocking_io at {time.strftime('%X')}\")\n"
"    # Note that time.sleep() can be replaced with any blocking\n"
"    # IO-bound operation, such as file operations.\n"
"    time.sleep(1)\n"
"    print(f\"blocking_io complete at {time.strftime('%X')}\")\n"
"\n"
"async def main():\n"
"    print(f\"started main at {time.strftime('%X')}\")\n"
"\n"
"    await asyncio.gather(\n"
"        asyncio.to_thread(blocking_io),\n"
"        asyncio.sleep(1))\n"
"\n"
"    print(f\"finished main at {time.strftime('%X')}\")\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"asyncio.run(main())\n"
"\n"
"# Expected output:\n"
"#\n"
"# started main at 19:50:53\n"
"# start blocking_io at 19:50:53\n"
"# blocking_io complete at 19:50:54\n"
"# finished main at 19:50:54"
msgstr ""
"def blocking_io():\n"
"    print(f\"start blocking_io at {time.strftime('%X')}\")\n"
"    # 請注意，time.sleep() 可以替換成任何阻塞的\n"
"    # IO 密集型操作，例如檔案操作。\n"
"    time.sleep(1)\n"
"    print(f\"blocking_io complete at {time.strftime('%X')}\")\n"
"\n"
"async def main():\n"
"    print(f\"started main at {time.strftime('%X')}\")\n"
"\n"
"    await asyncio.gather(\n"
"        asyncio.to_thread(blocking_io),\n"
"        asyncio.sleep(1))\n"
"\n"
"    print(f\"finished main at {time.strftime('%X')}\")\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"asyncio.run(main())\n"
"\n"
"# 預期的輸出：\n"
"#\n"
"# started main at 19:50:53\n"
"# start blocking_io at 19:50:53\n"
"# blocking_io complete at 19:50:54\n"
"# finished main at 19:50:54"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1070
msgid ""
"Directly calling ``blocking_io()`` in any coroutine would block the event "
"loop for its duration, resulting in an additional 1 second of run time. "
"Instead, by using ``asyncio.to_thread()``, we can run it in a separate "
"thread without blocking the event loop."
msgstr ""
"在任何協程中直接呼叫 ``blocking_io()`` 都會在其執行期間阻塞事件迴圈，導致額"
"外 1 秒的執行時間。改為使用 ``asyncio.to_thread()``，就可以在另一個執行緒中執"
"行它，而不會阻塞事件迴圈。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1077
msgid ""
"Due to the :term:`GIL`, ``asyncio.to_thread()`` can typically only be used "
"to make IO-bound functions non-blocking. However, for extension modules that "
"release the GIL or alternative Python implementations that don't have one, "
"``asyncio.to_thread()`` can also be used for CPU-bound functions."
msgstr ""
"由於 :term:`GIL` 的關係，``asyncio.to_thread()`` 通常只能用來讓 IO 密集型函式"
"變成非阻塞的。然而，對於會釋放 GIL 的擴充模組或沒有 GIL 的其他 Python 實作，"
"``asyncio.to_thread()`` 也可以用於 CPU 密集型 (CPU-bound) 函式。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1086
msgid "Scheduling from other threads"
msgstr "從其他執行緒中排程"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1090
msgid "Submit a coroutine to the given event loop.  Thread-safe."
msgstr "將協程提交到給定的事件迴圈。此函式為執行緒安全。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1092
msgid ""
"Return a :class:`concurrent.futures.Future` to wait for the result from "
"another OS thread."
msgstr ""
"回傳一個 :class:`concurrent.futures.Future`，以便從另一個 OS 執行緒等待結果。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1095
msgid ""
"This function is meant to be called from a different OS thread than the one "
"where the event loop is running.  Example::"
msgstr "此函式應從與事件迴圈所在執行緒不同的 OS 執行緒中呼叫。範例： ::"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1098
msgid ""
"def in_thread(loop: asyncio.AbstractEventLoop) -> None:\n"
"    # Run some blocking IO\n"
"    pathlib.Path(\"example.txt\").write_text(\"hello world\", "
"encoding=\"utf8\")\n"
"\n"
"    # Create a coroutine\n"
"    coro = asyncio.sleep(1, result=3)\n"
"\n"
"    # Submit the coroutine to a given loop\n"
"    future = asyncio.run_coroutine_threadsafe(coro, loop)\n"
"\n"
"    # Wait for the result with an optional timeout argument\n"
"    assert future.result(timeout=2) == 3\n"
"\n"
"async def amain() -> None:\n"
"    # Get the running loop\n"
"    loop = asyncio.get_running_loop()\n"
"\n"
"    # Run something in a thread\n"
"    await asyncio.to_thread(in_thread, loop)"
msgstr ""
"def in_thread(loop: asyncio.AbstractEventLoop) -> None:\n"
"    # 執行一些阻塞的 IO\n"
"    pathlib.Path(\"example.txt\").write_text(\"hello world\", "
"encoding=\"utf8\")\n"
"\n"
"    # 建立一個協程\n"
"    coro = asyncio.sleep(1, result=3)\n"
"\n"
"    # 將協程提交到給定的迴圈\n"
"    future = asyncio.run_coroutine_threadsafe(coro, loop)\n"
"\n"
"    # 等待結果，可選擇性地傳入 timeout 引數\n"
"    assert future.result(timeout=2) == 3\n"
"\n"
"async def amain() -> None:\n"
"    # 取得正在執行的迴圈\n"
"    loop = asyncio.get_running_loop()\n"
"\n"
"    # 在執行緒中執行某些東西\n"
"    await asyncio.to_thread(in_thread, loop)"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1118
msgid "It's also possible to run the other way around.  Example::"
msgstr "也可以反過來執行。範例： ::"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1120
msgid ""
"@contextlib.contextmanager\n"
"def loop_in_thread() -> Generator[asyncio.AbstractEventLoop]:\n"
"    loop_fut = concurrent.futures.Future[asyncio.AbstractEventLoop]()\n"
"    stop_event = asyncio.Event()\n"
"\n"
"    async def main() -> None:\n"
"        loop_fut.set_result(asyncio.get_running_loop())\n"
"        await stop_event.wait()\n"
"\n"
"    with concurrent.futures.ThreadPoolExecutor(1) as tpe:\n"
"        complete_fut = tpe.submit(asyncio.run, main())\n"
"        for fut in concurrent.futures.as_completed((loop_fut, "
"complete_fut)):\n"
"            if fut is loop_fut:\n"
"                loop = loop_fut.result()\n"
"                try:\n"
"                    yield loop\n"
"                finally:\n"
"                    loop.call_soon_threadsafe(stop_event.set)\n"
"            else:\n"
"                fut.result()\n"
"\n"
"# Create a loop in another thread\n"
"with loop_in_thread() as loop:\n"
"    # Create a coroutine\n"
"    coro = asyncio.sleep(1, result=3)\n"
"\n"
"    # Submit the coroutine to a given loop\n"
"    future = asyncio.run_coroutine_threadsafe(coro, loop)\n"
"\n"
"    # Wait for the result with an optional timeout argument\n"
"    assert future.result(timeout=2) == 3"
msgstr ""
"@contextlib.contextmanager\n"
"def loop_in_thread() -> Generator[asyncio.AbstractEventLoop]:\n"
"    loop_fut = concurrent.futures.Future[asyncio.AbstractEventLoop]()\n"
"    stop_event = asyncio.Event()\n"
"\n"
"    async def main() -> None:\n"
"        loop_fut.set_result(asyncio.get_running_loop())\n"
"        await stop_event.wait()\n"
"\n"
"    with concurrent.futures.ThreadPoolExecutor(1) as tpe:\n"
"        complete_fut = tpe.submit(asyncio.run, main())\n"
"        for fut in concurrent.futures.as_completed((loop_fut, "
"complete_fut)):\n"
"            if fut is loop_fut:\n"
"                loop = loop_fut.result()\n"
"                try:\n"
"                    yield loop\n"
"                finally:\n"
"                    loop.call_soon_threadsafe(stop_event.set)\n"
"            else:\n"
"                fut.result()\n"
"\n"
"# 在另一個執行緒中建立迴圈\n"
"with loop_in_thread() as loop:\n"
"    # 建立一個協程\n"
"    coro = asyncio.sleep(1, result=3)\n"
"\n"
"    # 將協程提交到給定的迴圈\n"
"    future = asyncio.run_coroutine_threadsafe(coro, loop)\n"
"\n"
"    # 等待結果，可選擇性地傳入 timeout 引數\n"
"    assert future.result(timeout=2) == 3"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1152
msgid ""
"If an exception is raised in the coroutine, the returned Future will be "
"notified.  It can also be used to cancel the task in the event loop::"
msgstr ""
"如果協程中引發了例外，回傳的 Future 會收到通知。它也可以用來取消事件迴圈中的"
"任務： ::"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1156
msgid ""
"try:\n"
"    result = future.result(timeout)\n"
"except TimeoutError:\n"
"    print('The coroutine took too long, cancelling the task...')\n"
"    future.cancel()\n"
"except Exception as exc:\n"
"    print(f'The coroutine raised an exception: {exc!r}')\n"
"else:\n"
"    print(f'The coroutine returned: {result!r}')"
msgstr ""
"try:\n"
"    result = future.result(timeout)\n"
"except TimeoutError:\n"
"    print('The coroutine took too long, cancelling the task...')\n"
"    future.cancel()\n"
"except Exception as exc:\n"
"    print(f'The coroutine raised an exception: {exc!r}')\n"
"else:\n"
"    print(f'The coroutine returned: {result!r}')"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1166
msgid ""
"See the :ref:`concurrency and multithreading <asyncio-multithreading>` "
"section of the documentation."
msgstr "請參閱文件的\\ :ref:`並行和多執行緒 <asyncio-multithreading>`\\ 部分。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1169
msgid ""
"Unlike other asyncio functions this function requires the *loop* argument to "
"be passed explicitly."
msgstr "與其他 asyncio 函式不同，此函式需要明確地傳入 *loop* 引數。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1176
msgid "Introspection"
msgstr "內省"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1181
msgid ""
"Return the currently running :class:`Task` instance, or ``None`` if no task "
"is running."
msgstr ""
"回傳目前正在執行的 :class:`Task` 實例，如果沒有正在執行的任務則回傳 "
"``None``。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1184
msgid ""
"If *loop* is ``None`` :func:`get_running_loop` is used to get the current "
"loop."
msgstr ""
"如果 *loop* 為 ``None``，則會使用 :func:`get_running_loop` 來取得目前的迴圈。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1192
msgid "Return a set of not yet finished :class:`Task` objects run by the loop."
msgstr "回傳由該迴圈執行且尚未完成的 :class:`Task` 物件的集合。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1195
msgid ""
"If *loop* is ``None``, :func:`get_running_loop` is used for getting current "
"loop."
msgstr ""
"如果 *loop* 為 ``None``，則會使用 :func:`get_running_loop` 來取得目前的迴圈。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1203
msgid "Return ``True`` if *obj* is a coroutine object."
msgstr "如果 *obj* 是一個協程物件，則回傳 ``True``。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1210
msgid "Task object"
msgstr "Task 物件"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1214
msgid ""
"A :class:`Future-like <Future>` object that runs a Python :ref:`coroutine "
"<coroutine>`.  Not thread-safe."
msgstr ""
"一個執行 Python :ref:`協程 <coroutine>`\\ 的\\ :class:`類 Future 物件 "
"<Future>`。不支援執行緒安全。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1217
msgid ""
"Tasks are used to run coroutines in event loops. If a coroutine awaits on a "
"Future, the Task suspends the execution of the coroutine and waits for the "
"completion of the Future.  When the Future is *done*, the execution of the "
"wrapped coroutine resumes."
msgstr ""
"Task 用於在事件迴圈中執行協程。如果一個協程正在等待一個 Future，Task 會暫停該"
"協程的執行並等待該 Future 完成。當該 Future 為 *done*\\ （完成）時，被包裝的"
"協程會恢復執行。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1223
msgid ""
"Event loops use cooperative scheduling: an event loop runs one Task at a "
"time.  While a Task awaits for the completion of a Future, the event loop "
"runs other Tasks, callbacks, or performs IO operations."
msgstr ""
"事件迴圈使用協作式排程 (cooperative scheduling)：一個事件迴圈一次只執行一個 "
"Task。當某個 Task 在等待 Future 完成時，事件迴圈會執行其他 Task、回呼或執行 "
"IO 操作。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1228
msgid ""
"Use the high-level :func:`asyncio.create_task` function to create Tasks, or "
"the low-level :meth:`loop.create_task` or :func:`ensure_future` functions.  "
"Manual instantiation of Tasks is discouraged."
msgstr ""
"使用高階的 :func:`asyncio.create_task` 函式來建立 Task，或使用低階的 :meth:"
"`loop.create_task` 或 :func:`ensure_future` 函式。不建議手動實例化 Task。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1233
msgid ""
"To cancel a running Task use the :meth:`cancel` method.  Calling it will "
"cause the Task to throw a :exc:`CancelledError` exception into the wrapped "
"coroutine.  If a coroutine is awaiting on a future-like object during "
"cancellation, the awaited object will be cancelled."
msgstr ""
"要取消一個正在執行的 Task，請使用 :meth:`cancel` 方法。呼叫它會使該 Task 將一"
"個 :exc:`CancelledError` 例外擲入被包裝的協程。如果協程在取消期間正在等待一個"
"類 Future 物件，該被等待的物件將會被取消。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1238
msgid ""
":meth:`cancelled` can be used to check if the Task was cancelled. The method "
"returns ``True`` if the wrapped coroutine did not suppress the :exc:"
"`CancelledError` exception and was actually cancelled."
msgstr ""
":meth:`cancelled` 可用來檢查 Task 是否已被取消。如果被包裝的協程沒有抑制 :"
"exc:`CancelledError` 例外並且確實被取消，該方法會回傳 ``True``。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1243
msgid ""
":class:`asyncio.Task` inherits from :class:`Future` all of its APIs except :"
"meth:`Future.set_result` and :meth:`Future.set_exception`."
msgstr ""
":class:`asyncio.Task` 從 :class:`Future` 繼承了除 :meth:`Future.set_result` "
"和 :meth:`Future.set_exception` 以外的所有 API。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1247
msgid ""
"An optional keyword-only *context* argument allows specifying a custom :"
"class:`contextvars.Context` for the *coro* to run in. If no *context* is "
"provided, the Task copies the current context and later runs its coroutine "
"in the copied context."
msgstr ""
"可選的僅限關鍵字引數 *context* 允許指定一個自訂的 :class:`contextvars."
"Context` 讓 *coro* 在其中執行。如果沒有提供 *context*，Task 會複製目前的情"
"境，並在之後於複製的情境中執行其協程。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1252
msgid ""
"An optional keyword-only *eager_start* argument allows eagerly starting the "
"execution of the :class:`asyncio.Task` at task creation time. If set to "
"``True`` and the event loop is running, the task will start executing the "
"coroutine immediately, until the first time the coroutine blocks. If the "
"coroutine returns or raises without blocking, the task will be finished "
"eagerly and will skip scheduling to the event loop."
msgstr ""
"可選的僅限關鍵字引數 *eager_start* 允許在建立任務時急切地開始執行 :class:"
"`asyncio.Task`。如果設為 ``True`` 且事件迴圈正在執行，該任務會立即開始執行協"
"程，直到協程第一次阻塞為止。如果協程在沒有阻塞的情況下回傳或引發例外，該任務"
"會急切地完成，並跳過排程到事件迴圈的步驟。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1259
msgid ""
"Tasks are :ref:`generic <generics>` over the return type of their wrapped "
"coroutines."
msgstr "Task 是以其所包裝之協程的回傳型別為參數的\\ :ref:`泛型 <generics>`。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1262
msgid "Added support for the :mod:`contextvars` module."
msgstr "新增對 :mod:`contextvars` 模組的支援。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1268
msgid ""
"Deprecation warning is emitted if *loop* is not specified and there is no "
"running event loop."
msgstr "如果未指定 *loop* 並且沒有正在執行的事件迴圈則會發出棄用警告。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1275
msgid "Added the *eager_start* parameter."
msgstr "新增 *eager_start* 參數。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1280
msgid "Return ``True`` if the Task is *done*."
msgstr "如果 Task 為 *done*，則回傳 ``True``。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1282
msgid ""
"A Task is *done* when the wrapped coroutine either returned a value, raised "
"an exception, or the Task was cancelled."
msgstr ""
"當被包裝的協程回傳了一個值、引發了一個例外，或者 Task 被取消時，該 Task 就是 "
"*done*。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1287
msgid "Return the result of the Task."
msgstr "回傳 Task 的結果。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1289
msgid ""
"If the Task is *done*, the result of the wrapped coroutine is returned (or "
"if the coroutine raised an exception, that exception is re-raised.)"
msgstr ""
"如果 Task 為 *done*，則回傳被包裝之協程的結果（或者如果協程引發了例外，則重新"
"引發該例外）。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1293 ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1307
msgid ""
"If the Task has been *cancelled*, this method raises a :exc:`CancelledError` "
"exception."
msgstr ""
"如果 Task 已被 *cancelled*\\ （取消），此方法會引發一個 :exc:"
"`CancelledError` 例外。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1296
msgid ""
"If the Task's result isn't yet available, this method raises an :exc:"
"`InvalidStateError` exception."
msgstr ""
"如果 Task 的結果還不可用，此方法會引發一個 :exc:`InvalidStateError` 例外。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1301
msgid "Return the exception of the Task."
msgstr "回傳 Task 的例外。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1303
msgid ""
"If the wrapped coroutine raised an exception that exception is returned.  If "
"the wrapped coroutine returned normally this method returns ``None``."
msgstr ""
"如果被包裝的協程引發了例外，則回傳該例外。如果被包裝的協程正常回傳，此方法會"
"回傳 ``None``。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1310
msgid ""
"If the Task isn't *done* yet, this method raises an :exc:`InvalidStateError` "
"exception."
msgstr ""
"如果 Task 尚未 *done*，此方法會引發一個 :exc:`InvalidStateError` 例外。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1315
msgid "Add a callback to be run when the Task is *done*."
msgstr "新增一個在 Task 為 *done* 時執行的回呼函式。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1317 ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1326
msgid "This method should only be used in low-level callback-based code."
msgstr "此方法只應用於低階、基於回呼的程式碼。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1319
msgid ""
"See the documentation of :meth:`Future.add_done_callback` for more details."
msgstr "更多細節請參閱 :meth:`Future.add_done_callback` 的文件。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1324
msgid "Remove *callback* from the callbacks list."
msgstr "從回呼列表中移除 *callback*。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1328
msgid ""
"See the documentation of :meth:`Future.remove_done_callback` for more "
"details."
msgstr "更多細節請參閱 :meth:`Future.remove_done_callback` 的文件。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1333
msgid "Return the list of stack frames for this Task."
msgstr "回傳此 Task 的堆疊框 (stack frame) 串列。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1335
msgid ""
"If the wrapped coroutine is not done, this returns the stack where it is "
"suspended.  If the coroutine has completed successfully or was cancelled, "
"this returns an empty list. If the coroutine was terminated by an exception, "
"this returns the list of traceback frames."
msgstr ""
"如果被包裝的協程尚未完成，則回傳其被暫停處的堆疊。如果協程已成功完成或已被取"
"消，則回傳一個空串列。如果協程因例外而終止，則回傳由回溯 (traceback) frame 組"
"成的串列。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1341
msgid "The frames are always ordered from oldest to newest."
msgstr "frame 一律按照從最舊到最新的順序排列。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1343
msgid "Only one stack frame is returned for a suspended coroutine."
msgstr "對於被暫停的協程，只會回傳一個堆疊框。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1345
msgid ""
"The optional *limit* argument sets the maximum number of frames to return; "
"by default all available frames are returned. The ordering of the returned "
"list differs depending on whether a stack or a traceback is returned: the "
"newest frames of a stack are returned, but the oldest frames of a traceback "
"are returned.  (This matches the behavior of the traceback module.)"
msgstr ""
"可選的 *limit* 引數設定要回傳的最大 frame 數；預設會回傳所有可用的 frame。回"
"傳串列的順序會依據回傳的是堆疊還是回溯而有所不同：堆疊會回傳最新的 frame，而"
"回溯會回傳最舊的 frame。（這與 traceback 模組的行為一致。）"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1354
msgid "Print the stack or traceback for this Task."
msgstr "印出此 Task 的堆疊或回溯。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1356
msgid ""
"This produces output similar to that of the traceback module for the frames "
"retrieved by :meth:`get_stack`."
msgstr ""
"對於由 :meth:`get_stack` 取得的 frame，這會產生類似於 traceback 模組的輸出。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1359
msgid "The *limit* argument is passed to :meth:`get_stack` directly."
msgstr "*limit* 引數會直接傳遞給 :meth:`get_stack`。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1361
msgid ""
"The *file* argument is an I/O stream to which the output is written; by "
"default output is written to :data:`sys.stdout`."
msgstr ""
"*file* 引數是輸出所寫入的 I/O 串流；預設情況下，輸出會寫入 :data:`sys."
"stdout`。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1366
msgid "Return the coroutine object wrapped by the :class:`Task`."
msgstr "回傳被 :class:`Task` 包裝的協程物件。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1370
msgid ""
"This will return ``None`` for Tasks which have already completed eagerly. "
"See the :ref:`Eager Task Factory <eager-task-factory>`."
msgstr ""
"對於已經急切完成的 Task，這會回傳 ``None``。請參閱\\ :ref:`急切任務工廠 "
"<eager-task-factory>`。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1377
msgid "Newly added eager task execution means result may be ``None``."
msgstr "新增的急切任務執行代表結果可能為 ``None``。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1381
msgid ""
"Return the :class:`contextvars.Context` object associated with the task."
msgstr "回傳與該任務相關聯的 :class:`contextvars.Context` 物件。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1388
msgid "Return the name of the Task."
msgstr "回傳 Task 的名稱。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1390
msgid ""
"If no name has been explicitly assigned to the Task, the default asyncio "
"Task implementation generates a default name during instantiation."
msgstr ""
"如果沒有明確地為 Task 指定名稱，預設的 asyncio Task 實作會在實例化期間產生一"
"個預設名稱。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1398
msgid "Set the name of the Task."
msgstr "設定 Task 的名稱。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1400
msgid ""
"The *value* argument can be any object, which is then converted to a string."
msgstr "*value* 引數可以是任何物件，之後會被轉換為字串。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1403
msgid ""
"In the default Task implementation, the name will be visible in the :func:"
"`repr` output of a task object."
msgstr "在預設的 Task 實作中，名稱會顯示在任務物件的 :func:`repr` 輸出中。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1410
msgid "Request the Task to be cancelled."
msgstr "請求取消 Task。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1412
msgid ""
"If the Task is already *done* or *cancelled*, return ``False``, otherwise, "
"return ``True``."
msgstr ""
"如果 Task 已經是 *done* 或 *cancelled*，則回傳 ``False``，否則回傳 ``True``。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1415
msgid ""
"The method arranges for a :exc:`CancelledError` exception to be thrown into "
"the wrapped coroutine on the next cycle of the event loop."
msgstr ""
"此方法會安排在事件迴圈的下一個週期將一個 :exc:`CancelledError` 例外擲入被包裝"
"的協程。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1418
msgid ""
"The coroutine then has a chance to clean up or even deny the request by "
"suppressing the exception with a :keyword:`try` ... ... ``except "
"CancelledError`` ... :keyword:`finally` block. Therefore, unlike :meth:"
"`Future.cancel`, :meth:`Task.cancel` does not guarantee that the Task will "
"be cancelled, although suppressing cancellation completely is not common and "
"is actively discouraged.  Should the coroutine nevertheless decide to "
"suppress the cancellation, it needs to call :meth:`Task.uncancel` in "
"addition to catching the exception."
msgstr ""
"協程接著就有機會進行清理，甚至可以透過 :keyword:`try` ... ... ``except "
"CancelledError`` ... :keyword:`finally` 區塊抑制該例外來拒絕該請求。因此，"
"與 :meth:`Future.cancel` 不同，:meth:`Task.cancel` 並不保證 Task 一定會被取"
"消，儘管完全抑制取消並不常見，而且強烈不建議這麼做。如果協程仍然決定要抑制取"
"消，除了捕捉例外之外，它還需要呼叫 :meth:`Task.uncancel`。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1428
msgid ""
"If the Task being cancelled is currently awaiting on a future-like object, "
"that awaited object will also be cancelled. This cancellation propagates "
"down the entire chain of awaited objects."
msgstr ""
"如果被取消的 Task 目前正在等待一個類 Future 物件，該被等待的物件也會被取消。"
"此取消會沿著整條被等待物件的鏈向下傳播。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1432
msgid "Added the *msg* parameter."
msgstr "新增 *msg* 參數。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1435
msgid "The ``msg`` parameter is propagated from cancelled task to its awaiter."
msgstr "``msg`` 參數會從被取消的任務傳播到其等待者。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1440
msgid ""
"The following example illustrates how coroutines can intercept the "
"cancellation request::"
msgstr "以下範例說明協程如何攔截取消請求： ::"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1443
msgid ""
"async def cancel_me():\n"
"    print('cancel_me(): before sleep')\n"
"\n"
"    try:\n"
"        # Wait for 1 hour\n"
"        await asyncio.sleep(3600)\n"
"    except asyncio.CancelledError:\n"
"        print('cancel_me(): cancel sleep')\n"
"        raise\n"
"    finally:\n"
"        print('cancel_me(): after sleep')\n"
"\n"
"async def main():\n"
"    # Create a \"cancel_me\" Task\n"
"    task = asyncio.create_task(cancel_me())\n"
"\n"
"    # Wait for 1 second\n"
"    await asyncio.sleep(1)\n"
"\n"
"    task.cancel()\n"
"    try:\n"
"        await task\n"
"    except asyncio.CancelledError:\n"
"        print(\"main(): cancel_me is cancelled now\")\n"
"\n"
"asyncio.run(main())\n"
"\n"
"# Expected output:\n"
"#\n"
"#     cancel_me(): before sleep\n"
"#     cancel_me(): cancel sleep\n"
"#     cancel_me(): after sleep\n"
"#     main(): cancel_me is cancelled now"
msgstr ""
"async def cancel_me():\n"
"    print('cancel_me(): before sleep')\n"
"\n"
"    try:\n"
"        # 等待 1 小時\n"
"        await asyncio.sleep(3600)\n"
"    except asyncio.CancelledError:\n"
"        print('cancel_me(): cancel sleep')\n"
"        raise\n"
"    finally:\n"
"        print('cancel_me(): after sleep')\n"
"\n"
"async def main():\n"
"    # 建立一個 \"cancel_me\" Task\n"
"    task = asyncio.create_task(cancel_me())\n"
"\n"
"    # 等待 1 秒\n"
"    await asyncio.sleep(1)\n"
"\n"
"    task.cancel()\n"
"    try:\n"
"        await task\n"
"    except asyncio.CancelledError:\n"
"        print(\"main(): cancel_me is cancelled now\")\n"
"\n"
"asyncio.run(main())\n"
"\n"
"# 預期的輸出：\n"
"#\n"
"#     cancel_me(): before sleep\n"
"#     cancel_me(): cancel sleep\n"
"#     cancel_me(): after sleep\n"
"#     main(): cancel_me is cancelled now"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1479
msgid "Return ``True`` if the Task is *cancelled*."
msgstr "如果 Task 已被 *cancelled*，則回傳 ``True``。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1481
msgid ""
"The Task is *cancelled* when the cancellation was requested with :meth:"
"`cancel` and the wrapped coroutine propagated the :exc:`CancelledError` "
"exception thrown into it."
msgstr ""
"當使用 :meth:`cancel` 請求取消，且被包裝的協程將擲入其中的 :exc:"
"`CancelledError` 例外傳播出去時，該 Task 即為 *cancelled*。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1487
msgid "Decrement the count of cancellation requests to this Task."
msgstr "將此 Task 的取消請求計數減一。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1489
msgid "Returns the remaining number of cancellation requests."
msgstr "回傳剩餘的取消請求數量。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1491
msgid ""
"Note that once execution of a cancelled task completed, further calls to :"
"meth:`uncancel` are ineffective."
msgstr ""
"請注意，一旦被取消之任務的執行已經完成，再呼叫 :meth:`uncancel` 將不會有任何"
"效果。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1496
msgid ""
"This method is used by asyncio's internals and isn't expected to be used by "
"end-user code.  In particular, if a Task gets successfully uncancelled, this "
"allows for elements of structured concurrency like :ref:`taskgroups` and :"
"func:`asyncio.timeout` to continue running, isolating cancellation to the "
"respective structured block. For example::"
msgstr ""
"此方法供 asyncio 內部使用，終端使用者的程式碼不應會用到它。特別是，如果一個 "
"Task 成功地被撤銷取消 (uncancelled)，這能讓像是\\ :ref:`任務群組 "
"<taskgroups>`\\ 和 :func:`asyncio.timeout` 這類結構化並行的元素繼續執行，將取"
"消隔離在各自的結構化區塊中。例如： ::"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1503
msgid ""
"async def make_request_with_timeout():\n"
"    try:\n"
"        async with asyncio.timeout(1):\n"
"            # Structured block affected by the timeout:\n"
"            await make_request()\n"
"            await make_another_request()\n"
"    except TimeoutError:\n"
"        log(\"There was a timeout\")\n"
"    # Outer code not affected by the timeout:\n"
"    await unrelated_code()"
msgstr ""
"async def make_request_with_timeout():\n"
"    try:\n"
"        async with asyncio.timeout(1):\n"
"            # 受超時影響的結構化區塊：\n"
"            await make_request()\n"
"            await make_another_request()\n"
"    except TimeoutError:\n"
"        log(\"There was a timeout\")\n"
"    # 不受超時影響的外部程式碼：\n"
"    await unrelated_code()"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1514
msgid ""
"While the block with ``make_request()`` and ``make_another_request()`` might "
"get cancelled due to the timeout, ``unrelated_code()`` should continue "
"running even in case of the timeout.  This is implemented with :meth:"
"`uncancel`.  :class:`TaskGroup` context managers use :func:`uncancel` in a "
"similar fashion."
msgstr ""
"雖然包含 ``make_request()`` 和 ``make_another_request()`` 的區塊可能會因超時"
"而被取消，但即使發生超時，``unrelated_code()`` 也應該繼續執行。這是透過 :"
"meth:`uncancel` 實作的。:class:`TaskGroup` 情境管理器也以類似的方式使用 :"
"func:`uncancel`。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1520
msgid ""
"If end-user code is, for some reason, suppressing cancellation by catching :"
"exc:`CancelledError`, it needs to call this method to remove the "
"cancellation state."
msgstr ""
"如果終端使用者的程式碼因為某些原因而透過捕捉 :exc:`CancelledError` 來抑制取"
"消，它就需要呼叫此方法來移除取消狀態。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1524
msgid ""
"When this method decrements the cancellation count to zero, the method "
"checks if a previous :meth:`cancel` call had arranged for :exc:"
"`CancelledError` to be thrown into the task. If it hasn't been thrown yet, "
"that arrangement will be rescinded (by resetting the internal "
"``_must_cancel`` flag)."
msgstr ""
"當此方法將取消計數遞減至零時，它會檢查先前的 :meth:`cancel` 呼叫是否已安排"
"將 :exc:`CancelledError` 擲入該任務。如果該例外尚未被擲入，則會撤銷該安排（透"
"過重設內部的 ``_must_cancel`` 旗標）。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1530
msgid "Changed to rescind pending cancellation requests upon reaching zero."
msgstr "改為在計數歸零時撤銷待處理的取消請求。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1535
msgid ""
"Return the number of pending cancellation requests to this Task, i.e., the "
"number of calls to :meth:`cancel` less the number of :meth:`uncancel` calls."
msgstr ""
"回傳對此 Task 待處理的取消請求數量，即 :meth:`cancel` 的呼叫次數減去 :meth:"
"`uncancel` 的呼叫次數。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1539
msgid ""
"Note that if this number is greater than zero but the Task is still "
"executing, :meth:`cancelled` will still return ``False``. This is because "
"this number can be lowered by calling :meth:`uncancel`, which can lead to "
"the task not being cancelled after all if the cancellation requests go down "
"to zero."
msgstr ""
"請注意，如果此數字大於零但 Task 仍在執行中，:meth:`cancelled` 仍然會回傳 "
"``False``。這是因為此數字可以透過呼叫 :meth:`uncancel` 來降低，如果取消請求降"
"到零，最終可能導致該任務根本不會被取消。"

#: ../../library/asyncio-task.rst:1545
msgid ""
"This method is used by asyncio's internals and isn't expected to be used by "
"end-user code.  See :meth:`uncancel` for more details."
msgstr ""
"此方法供 asyncio 內部使用，終端使用者的程式碼不應會用到它。更多細節請參閱 :"
"meth:`uncancel`。"

#~ msgid "Terminating a task group"
#~ msgstr "終止任務群組"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "While terminating a task group is not natively supported by the standard "
#~ "library, termination can be achieved by adding an exception-raising task "
#~ "to the task group and ignoring the raised exception:"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "雖然標準函式庫並未原生支援終止任務群組，但可以透過在任務群組中加入一個會引"
#~ "發例外的任務，並忽略所引發的例外來達成終止："

#~ msgid ""
#~ "import asyncio\n"
#~ "from asyncio import TaskGroup\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "class TerminateTaskGroup(Exception):\n"
#~ "    \"\"\"Exception raised to terminate a task group.\"\"\"\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "async def force_terminate_task_group():\n"
#~ "    \"\"\"Used to force termination of a task group.\"\"\"\n"
#~ "    raise TerminateTaskGroup()\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "async def job(task_id, sleep_time):\n"
#~ "    print(f'Task {task_id}: start')\n"
#~ "    await asyncio.sleep(sleep_time)\n"
#~ "    print(f'Task {task_id}: done')\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "async def main():\n"
#~ "    try:\n"
#~ "        async with TaskGroup() as group:\n"
#~ "            # spawn some tasks\n"
#~ "            group.create_task(job(1, 0.5))\n"
#~ "            group.create_task(job(2, 1.5))\n"
#~ "            # sleep for 1 second\n"
#~ "            await asyncio.sleep(1)\n"
#~ "            # add an exception-raising task to force the group to "
#~ "terminate\n"
#~ "            group.create_task(force_terminate_task_group())\n"
#~ "    except* TerminateTaskGroup:\n"
#~ "        pass\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "asyncio.run(main())"
